#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.title"
msgstr "Guhindura amategeko y'uburenganzira bwo kwandika birakenewe ku mutekano w'igihugu"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.tldr"
msgstr "TL;DR: LLMs z'Abashinwa (harimo na DeepSeek) zitozwa ku bubiko bwanjye butemewe bw'ibitabo n'impapuro — ari bwo bunini ku isi. Iburengerazuba rikeneye guhindura amategeko y'uburenganzira bwo kwandika nk'ikibazo cy'umutekano w'igihugu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.subtitle"
msgstr "Inyandiko zifatanya na TorrentFreak: <a %(torrentfreak)s>iya mbere</a>, <a %(torrentfreak_2)s>iya kabiri</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text1"
msgstr "Mu minsi ishize, “inzu z'ibitabo z'igicucu” zari ziri mu marembera. Sci-Hub, ububiko bunini butemewe bw'impapuro z'ubushakashatsi, bwari bwarahagaritse kwakira ibihangano bishya, kubera imanza. “Z-Library”, inzu y'ibitabo nini itemewe, yabonye abayishinze bashinjwa ibyaha by'uburenganzira bwo kwandika. Babashije guhunga ifatwa ryabo, ariko inzu yabo y'ibitabo ntikiri mu kaga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text2"
msgstr "Igihe Z-Library yahangaga n'ifungwa, nari naramaze kubika ububiko bwayo bwose kandi nashakaga urubuga rwo kubicumbikira. Ibyo byari impamvu yanjye yo gutangiza Igitabo cya Anna: gukomeza intego y'ibikorwa byabanje. Kuva icyo gihe twarakuriye tuba inzu y'ibitabo y'igicucu nini ku isi, icumbikiye ibitabo birenga miliyoni 140 byanditsweho uburenganzira bwo kwandika mu buryo butandukanye — ibitabo, impapuro z'ubushakashatsi, ibinyamakuru, ibinyamakuru byanditse, n'ibindi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text3"
msgstr "Itsinda ryanjye nanjye turi ab'ideoloji. Twemera ko kubika no gucumbikira izi nyandiko ari icyiza mu buryo bw'ubumuntu. Inzu z'ibitabo ku isi hose zirimo kugabanyirizwa inkunga, kandi ntitwakwizera umurage w'ubumuntu ku bigo by'ubucuruzi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text4"
msgstr "Hanyuma haje AI. Ibigo byose bikomeye byubaka LLMs byatwandikiye ngo byitoreze ku makuru yacu. Benshi (ariko si bose!) mu bigo byo muri Amerika byongeye gutekereza nyuma yo kumenya ko ibikorwa byacu bitemewe. Mu gihe Abashinwa bo, bemeye ububiko bwacu bishimye, bisa nk'aho batitaye ku mategeko yabwo. Ibi biratangaje bitewe n'uruhare rwa China nk'umunyamuryango w'amasezerano mpuzamahanga menshi y'uburenganzira bwo kwandika."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text5"
msgstr "Twahaye uburenganzira bwo kwinjira ku muvuduko mwinshi ibigo bigera kuri 30. Benshi muri bo ni ibigo bya LLM, kandi hari n'abacuruzi b'amakuru, bazagurisha ububiko bwacu. Benshi ni Abashinwa, n'ubwo twakoranye n'ibigo byo muri Amerika, Uburayi, Uburusiya, Koreya y'Epfo, na Japani. DeepSeek <a %(arxiv)s>yemeye</a> ko icyiciro cyabanje cyatojwe ku gice cy'ububiko bwacu, nubwo batavuga byinshi ku cyiciro cyabo gishya (gishobora kuba cyaratojwe ku makuru yacu kandi)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text6"
msgstr "Niba Iburengerazuba rishaka kuguma imbere mu marushanwa ya LLMs, kandi amaherezo, AGI, rikeneye gusubiramo umwanya waryo ku burenganzira bwo kwandika, kandi vuba. Niba wemera cyangwa utemeranya natwe ku mpamvu zacu z'ubumuntu, ubu birimo kuba ikibazo cy'ubukungu, ndetse n'umutekano w'igihugu. Imbaraga zose ziri kubaka abahanga mu by'ubumenyi bw'ubwenge, abahanga mu by'ubumenyi bw'ubwenge, n'igisirikare cy'ubwenge. Uburenganzira bwo kumenya burimo kuba ikibazo cyo kubaho kuri ibi bihugu — ndetse n'umutekano w'igihugu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text7"
msgstr "Itsinda ryacu rituruka impande zose z'isi, kandi ntitugira uruhande runaka. Ariko twashishikariza ibihugu bifite amategeko akomeye ku byerekeye uburenganzira bwo kwandika gukoresha iyi ngorane y'ibanze kugira ngo babikosore. None se dukore iki?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text8"
msgstr "Icyifuzo cyacu cya mbere kiroroshye: kugabanya igihe cy'uburenganzira bw'umwanditsi. Muri Amerika, uburenganzira bw'umwanditsi butangwa imyaka 70 nyuma y'urupfu rw'umwanditsi. Ibi ni ibidashoboka. Dushobora kubihuza n'ibyangombwa by'ubuvumbuzi, bitangwa imyaka 20 nyuma yo gutanga dosiye. Ibi bikwiye kuba bihagije ku banditsi b'ibitabo, inyandiko, umuziki, ubuhanzi, n'ibindi bihangano, kugira ngo bishyurwe byuzuye ku mbaraga zabo (harimo n'imishinga y'igihe kirekire nk'ibikorwa byo gukina filime)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text9"
msgstr "Hanyuma, byibuze, abashinzwe politike bakwiye gushyiramo uburyo bwo kubika no gukwirakwiza ibitabo ku bwinshi. Niba igihombo cy’amafaranga aturuka ku bakiriya ku giti cyabo ari cyo kibazo nyamukuru, gukwirakwiza ku rwego rw’umuntu kuguma kubujijwe. Mu buryo bw'inyongera, abashoboye gucunga ububiko bunini — ibigo byigisha LLMs, hamwe n’amasomero n’andi makusanyirizo — bazaba barimo muri izi mpamvu zidasanzwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text10"
msgstr "Bimwe mu bihugu bimaze gukora iyi gahunda. TorrentFreak <a %(torrentfreak)s>yatangaje</a> ko Ubushinwa na Japani byashyizeho ubudasa bwa AI mu mategeko y’uburenganzira bw’umwanditsi. Ntitwamenya neza uko ibi bihura n’amasezerano mpuzamahanga, ariko biragaragara ko bitanga uburinzi ku bigo byabo by’imbere mu gihugu, bisobanura ibyo twabonye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text11"
msgstr "Ku bijyanye na Arikivu ya Anna — tuzakomeza akazi kacu ko mu bwihisho gushingiye ku myemerere y'ubumuntu. Ariko icyifuzo cyacu gikomeye ni ukujya mu mucyo, no kongera ingaruka zacu mu buryo bwemewe n'amategeko. Nyamuneka muvugurure amategeko y'uburenganzira bw'umwanditsi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.signature"
msgstr "- Anna n'itsinda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.postscript"
msgstr "Soma inkuru zifatanye na TorrentFreak: <a %(torrentfreak)s>iya mbere</a>, <a %(torrentfreak_2)s>iya kabiri</a>"

