#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.text1"
msgstr "Hashize amezi make dutangaje <a %(all_isbns)s>igihembo cya $10,000</a> cyo gukora ishusho nziza ishoboka y'ibipimo byacu byerekana ISBN. Twashyize imbere kwerekana dosiye dufite/ntitwabitse, kandi nyuma twongeyeho dataset isobanura umubare w’amasomero afite ISBNs (igipimo cy’ubuke)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.text2"
msgstr "Twashimishijwe cyane n'uburyo abantu bitabiriye. Habayeho ubuhanzi bwinshi. Murakoze cyane kuri buri wese witabiriye: imbaraga n'ubushake byanyu birandura!"

