#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winner.text5"
msgstr "Nyamuneka reba <a %(all_isbns)s>inyandiko y’umwimerere kuri blog</a> kugira ngo ubone amakuru arambuye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winner.text6"
msgstr "Twatanze intego yo kunoza ibi. Tuzatanga igihembo cya mbere cya $6,000, icya kabiri cya $3,000, n’icya gatatu cya $1,000. Kubera igisubizo cyinshi n’inyandiko zidasanzwe, twafashe icyemezo cyo kongera igihembo gike, no gutanga igihembo cya gatatu ku bantu bane, buri umwe $500. Abatsinze bari hasi aha, ariko nyamuneka reba inyandiko zose <a %(annas_archive)s>aha</a>, cyangwa ukure <a %(a_2025_01_isbn_visualization_files)s>torrent yacu ihuriweho</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.first"
msgstr "Igihembo cya mbere $6,000: phiresky"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.first.text1"
msgstr "Iyi <a %(phiresky_github)s>nyandiko</a> (<a %(annas_archive_note_2951)s>igitekerezo kuri Gitlab</a>) ni byose twifuzaga, ndetse birenze! By’umwihariko twakunze uburyo bwo kugaragaza ibintu butandukanye cyane (n’ubushobozi bwo gushyigikira shaders zihariye), ariko bufite urutonde rwuzuye rw’ibyateganijwe. Twakunze kandi uburyo byose byihuta kandi bikorohereza, ishyirwa mu bikorwa ryoroheje (ridafite backend), minimap y’ubwenge, n’igisobanuro kirambuye mu <a %(phiresky_github)s>nyandiko yabo kuri blog</a>. Akazi kadasanzwe, kandi ni umutsinzi ukwiye!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second"
msgstr "Igihembo cya kabiri $3,000: hypha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text1"
msgstr "Indi <a %(annas_archive_note_2913)s>nyandiko</a> idasanzwe. Ntabwo ifite ubushobozi nk’ubwa mbere, ariko twakunze uburyo bwo kugaragaza ibintu ku rwego rusange kurusha iya mbere (umurongo wuzuye, imipaka, ibirango, kugaragaza, kugenda, no kwegera). Igitekerezo <a %(annas_archive_note_2971)s>cyatanzwe na Joe Davis</a> cyadushimishije:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.quote"
msgstr "“Nubwo impande z’ingirakamaro n’udukubo byuzuye neza mu mibare, ntibihesha umwihariko mwiza mu bijyanye no gushushanya. Ntekereza ko kutangana kw’izi Hilbert cyangwa Morton gakondo atari inenge ahubwo ari umwihariko. Nk’uko ishusho y’inkweto y’Ubutaliyani izwi cyane ku ikarita, ‘udushya’ twihariye tw’izi mbavu dushobora kuba ibimenyetso by’ubwenge. Uyu mwihariko ushobora kongera kwibuka aho hantu no gufasha abakoresha kumenya aho bari, bikaba byoroshye kubona uturere twihariye cyangwa kubona imiterere.”"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text2"
msgstr "Kandi hari amahitamo menshi yo kwerekana no gushushanya, hamwe na UI itunganye cyane kandi yoroheje. Umwanya wa kabiri ukomeye!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third1"
msgstr "Umwanya wa gatatu $500 #1: maxlion"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third1.text1"
msgstr "Muri iyi <a %(annas_archive_note_2940)s>submission</a> twakunze cyane ubwoko butandukanye bw’imbonerahamwe, cyane cyane imbonerahamwe yagereranyije n’iy’abanditsi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third2"
msgstr "Umwanya wa gatatu $500 #2: abetusk"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third2.text1"
