#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aac"
msgstr "<strong>AAC.</strong> AAC (Ikibindi cya Arikivu ya Anna) ni ikintu kimwe kigizwe na <strong>metadata</strong>, kandi byashoboka <strong>binary data</strong>, byombi bidashobora guhinduka. Ifite umwirondoro wihariye ku isi yose, witwa <strong>AACID</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.collection"
msgstr "<strong>Urutonde.</strong> Buri AAC ni urutonde, urutonde rw'urutonde rwa AACs rufite isano. Ibyo bisobanuye ko niba uhinduye byinshi ku buryo bwa metadata, ugomba gukora urutonde rushya."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.records-files"
msgstr "<strong>“inyandiko” n’“amadosiye” urutonde.</strong> Mu buryo busanzwe, biroroshye kurekura “inyandiko” n’“amadosiye” nk’urutonde rutandukanye, bityo bikaba byarekurwa ku bipimo bitandukanye, urugero hashingiwe ku bipimo byo gukurura. “Inyandiko” ni urutonde rwa metadata gusa, rurimo amakuru nk’amazina y’ibitabo, abanditsi, ISBNs, n'ibindi, mu gihe “amadosiye” ari urutonde rurimo amadosiye nyirizina (pdf, epub)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid"
msgstr "<strong>AACID.</strong> Imiterere ya AACID ni iyi: <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__{collection}__{ISO 8601 timestamp}__{collection-specific ID}__{shortuuid}</code>. Urugero, AACID nyirizina twashyize ahagaragara ni <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z__22433983__URsJNGy5CjokTsNT6hUmmj</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection"
msgstr "<code>{collection}</code>: izina ry'urutonde, rishobora kuba rifite inyuguti za ASCII, imibare, n'utumenyetso tw'ubusumbane (ariko nta busumbane bubiri)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.iso8601"
msgstr "<code>{ISO 8601 timestamp}</code>: igice gito cya ISO 8601, buri gihe muri UTC, urugero <code>20220723T194746Z</code>. Uyu mubare ugomba kwiyongera buri gihe ku kurekura, nubwo imiterere yawo ishobora gutandukana kuri buri rutonde. Turasaba gukoresha igihe cyo gukurura cyangwa gukora ID."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection-id"
msgstr "<code>{collection-specific ID}</code>: umwirondoro wihariye w'ikusanyirizo, niba bishoboka, urugero ID ya Z-Library. Birashobora gusibwa cyangwa kugabanywa. Bigomba gusibwa cyangwa kugabanywa niba AACID irengeje inyuguti 150."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.shortuuid"
msgstr "<code>{shortuuid}</code>: UUID ariko yanditswe mu nyuguti za ASCII, urugero ukoresheje base57. Ubu dukoresha <a %(github_skorokithakis_shortuuid)s>shortuuid</a> Python library."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid-range"
msgstr "<strong>Urutonde rwa AACID.</strong> Kubera ko AACID zifite ibihe byiyongera mu buryo butajegajega, dushobora kubikoresha kugaragaza urutonde rw'ibiri mu ikusanyirizo runaka. Dukoresha ubu buryo: <code style=\"color: blue\">aacid__{collection}__{from_timestamp}--{to_timestamp}</code>, aho ibihe by'igihe byemerwa. Ibi bihuye n'uburyo bwa ISO 8601. Urutonde ni urudacikagurika kandi rushobora kwivanga, ariko mu gihe habayeho kwivanga rugomba kuba rufite inyandiko zisa n'izari zasohotse mbere muri iryo kusanyirizo (kubera ko AAC zidahinduka). Inyandiko zibura ntizemewe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file"
msgstr "<strong>Inyandiko ya metadata.</strong> Inyandiko ya metadata ikubiyemo metadata y'urutonde rwa AAC, ku ikusanyirizo runaka. Izi zifite ibi bikurikira:"

