#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.prefix"
msgstr "Intangiriro <code style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</code> ishobora guhindurwa ku izina ry'ikigo cyanyu, urugero <code style=\"color: red\">my_institute_meta__</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary"
msgstr "<strong>Ububiko bwa binary.</strong> Ububiko bufite amakuru ya binary y'urutonde rwa AAC, ku ikusanyirizo runaka. Ibi bifite ibi bikurikira:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.name"
msgstr "Izina ry'ububiko rigomba kuba urutonde rwa AACID, rwatangijwe na <code style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</code>, nta nyongera. Urugero, imwe mu nsohora zacu ifite ububiko bwitwa<br><code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_files__20230808T055130Z--20230808T055131Z</span></code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.contents"
