#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.heading"
msgstr "Urugero"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text1"
msgstr "Reka turebe ku nsohora yacu ya vuba ya Z-Library nk'urugero. Igizwe n'ikusanyirizo ebyiri: “<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>” na “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>”. Ibi bidufasha gukurura no gusohora inyandiko za metadata zitandukanye n'inyandiko z'ibitabo nyirizina. Bityo, twasohoye torrents ebyiri zifite inyandiko za metadata:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text2"
msgstr "Twongeyeho kandi torrents nyinshi zifite ububiko bwa binary, ariko gusa ku ikusanyirizo “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>”, 62 muri rusange:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text3"
msgstr "Mugukoresha <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z.jsonl.zst</span></code> turashobora kureba ibirimo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text4"
msgstr "Muri iki gihe, ni metadata y'igitabo nk'uko byatangajwe na Z-Library. Ku rwego rwo hejuru dufite gusa “aacid” na “metadata”, ariko nta “data_folder”, kuko nta makuru ya binary ahwanye. AACID ikubiyemo “22430000” nk'indangamuntu y'ibanze, dushobora kubona ko yafashwe muri “zlibrary_id”. Dushobora kwitega ko izindi AACs muri iri kusanyirizo zifite imiterere imwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text5"
msgstr "None reka dukoreshe <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230809T223215Z.jsonl.zst</span></code>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text6"
msgstr "Iyi ni metadata ntoya cyane ya AAC, nubwo igice kinini cy'iyi AAC kiboneka ahandi muri dosiye ya binary! Nyuma ya byose, dufite \"data_folder\" iyi nshuro, bityo dushobora kwitega ko amakuru ya binary ahuye nayo aboneka kuri <code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230808T051504Z</span>/<span style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z__22433983__NRgUGwTJYJpkQjTbz2jA3M</span></code>. \"Metadata\" irimo \"zlibrary_id\", bityo dushobora kuyihuza byoroshye na AAC ihuye nayo mu \"zlib_records\" collection. Twashoboraga kuyihuza mu buryo butandukanye, urugero binyuze kuri AACID — igipimo ntikibitegeka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text7"
msgstr "Icyitonderwa ni uko atari ngombwa ko umurima wa \"metadata\" ubwawo uba JSON. Ushobora kuba umugozi urimo XML cyangwa indi format y'amakuru. Ushobora no kubika amakuru ya metadata mu gice cya binary gihuye nayo, urugero niba ari amakuru menshi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.heading"
msgstr "Umwanzuro"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text1"
msgstr "Uko igipimo giteye, dushobora gukora amashyirahamwe mu buryo bwiyongera, kandi tukongeramo byoroshye amasoko mashya y'amakuru. Dufite amashyirahamwe amwe ateye amatsiko mu nzira!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text2"
msgstr "Twizera kandi ko bizoroha ku zindi maktaba z'igicucu kwigana amatorero yacu. Nyuma ya byose, intego yacu ni uguhorana ubumenyi n'umuco w'abantu, bityo uko byaba byinshi cyane ni byiza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion"
msgstr "- Anna n'itsinda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.title"
msgstr "Amakuru ya Anna: isomero ry'ubwisanzure bwose, ElasticSearch, 300GB+ y'ibifuniko by'ibitabo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.tldr"
msgstr "Twakoze amasaha yose kugira ngo dutange ubundi buryo bwiza hamwe na Anna’s Archive. Dore bimwe mu byo twagezeho vuba aha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.text1"
msgstr "Hamwe na Z-Library igenda hasi n'abashinzwe (bivugwa) gufatwa, twakoze amasaha yose kugira ngo dutange ubundi buryo bwiza hamwe na Anna’s Archive (ntituzayihuza hano, ariko ushobora kuyishakisha kuri Google). Dore bimwe mu byo twagezeho vuba aha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source"
msgstr "Anna’s Archive ni isomero ry'ubwisanzure bwose"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text1"
msgstr "Twizera ko amakuru agomba kuba ubuntu, kandi code yacu ubwayo si ubudasa. Twashyizeho code yacu yose ku rubuga rwacu rwa Gitlab rwihariye: <a %(annas_archive)s>Anna’s Software</a>. Dukoresha kandi ikurikirana ry'ibibazo mu gutegura akazi kacu. Niba ushaka kwifatanya n'iterambere ryacu, aha ni ahantu heza ho gutangirira."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text2"
msgstr "Kugira ngo uguhe icyitegererezo cy'ibyo dukora, fata akazi kacu ka vuba ku kunoza imikorere y'ibikoresho by'abakiriya. Kubera ko tutarashyiraho urupapuro rw'urutonde, twakundaga kugarura impapuro z'ubushakashatsi ndende cyane, zifite ibisubizo 100-200. Ntabwo twashakaga guhagarika ibisubizo by'ubushakashatsi vuba cyane, ariko ibi byatumye bigenda buhoro ku bikoresho bimwe. Kubw'ibi, twashyizeho ubuhanga buto: twapfunyitse ibisubizo byinshi by'ubushakashatsi mu bitekerezo bya HTML (<code><!-- --></code>), hanyuma twandika Javascript ntoya izamenya igihe igisubizo kigomba kugaragara, icyo gihe tukavanaho igitekerezo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text3"
msgstr "DOM \"virtualization\" yashyizwe mu bikorwa mu mirongo 23, nta mpamvu yo gukenera amasomero ahambaye! Ibi ni byo code yihuse pragmatique ugera ku gihe ufite igihe gito, kandi ibibazo by'ukuri bigomba gukemurwa. Byatangajwe ko ubushakashatsi bwacu ubu bukora neza ku bikoresho bigenda buhoro!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text4"
msgstr "Ikindi gikorwa kinini cyari ugushyira mu buryo bwikora kubaka database. Igihe twatangiraga, twakusanije amasoko atandukanye mu buryo butunguranye. Ubu dushaka kubikomeza byavuguruwe, bityo twanditse scripts nyinshi zo gukuramo metadata nshya mu mashami abiri ya Library Genesis, no kuyahuza. Intego ni ugukora ibi ntibibe byiza gusa kuri archive yacu, ahubwo no korohereza umuntu wese ushaka gukina n'ubumenyi bwa maktaba y'igicucu. Intego yaba Jupyter notebook ifite metadata itandukanye iteye amatsiko, bityo dushobora gukora ubushakashatsi bwinshi nko kumenya <a %(blog)s>igihe kingana kingana na ISBNs zibitswe iteka</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text5"
msgstr "Mu mpera, twavuguruye uburyo bwacu bwo gutanga inkunga. Ubu ushobora gukoresha ikarita y'inguzanyo gushyira amafaranga mu mifuka yacu ya crypto, utagomba kumenya byinshi kuri cryptocurrencies. Tuzakomeza gukurikirana uko ibi bikora mu buryo bw'ukuri, ariko ibi ni ikintu kinini."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es"
msgstr "Guhindura kuri ElasticSearch"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text1"
msgstr "Kimwe mu <a %(annas_archive)s>matike</a> yacu cyari igikapu cy'ibibazo hamwe n'uburyo bwacu bwo gushakisha. Twakoresheje MySQL full-text search, kuko twari dufite amakuru yacu yose muri MySQL. Ariko yari afite imipaka yayo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem1"
msgstr "Ibibazo bimwe byafashe igihe kirekire cyane, ku buryo byafungaga imiyoboro yose ifunguye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem2"
msgstr "By default MySQL ifite uburebure bw'ijambo rito, cyangwa index yawe irashobora kuba nini cyane. Abantu batangaje ko batashoboye gushakisha \"Ben Hur\"."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem3"
msgstr "Ubushakashatsi bwari bwihuse gusa igihe bwari bwuzuye mu bwenge, byasabaga ko tubona imashini ihenze kurushaho yo kubikoresha, hamwe n'amabwiriza yo gutangiza index ku itangira."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem4"
msgstr "Ntitwari gushobora kubyagura byoroshye ngo twubake imikorere mishya, nko gutoranya neza <a %(wikipedia_cjk_characters)s>ibimenyetso ku ndimi zidafite intera</a>, guhitamo/guhitamo, gutondeka, inama z'ibyo ushaka kuvuga, kwiyandikisha, n'ibindi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text2"
msgstr "Nyuma yo kuganira n'inzobere nyinshi, twahisemo gukoresha ElasticSearch. Ntabwo byagenze neza cyane (ibyo batanze by'ibanze bya \"waba ushaka kuvuga\" n'ibikorwa byo kwihutisha byari bibi), ariko muri rusange byari byiza cyane kurusha MySQL mu gushakisha. Ntabwo turacyizera cyane kuyikoresha ku makuru y'ingenzi cyane (nubwo bakoze intambwe nyinshi), ariko muri rusange turishimye cyane n'uko twahinduye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text3"
msgstr "Kugeza ubu, twashyizeho uburyo bwo gushakisha bwihuse cyane, gushyigikira indimi neza, gutondeka neza, amahitamo atandukanye yo gutondeka, no kuyungurura ku rurimi/ubwoko bw'igitabo/ubwoko bw'inyandiko. Niba wifuza kumenya uko bikora, <a %(annas_archive_l140)s>reba</a> <a %(annas_archive_l1115)s>aha</a> <a %(annas_archive_l1635)s>hano</a>. Biroroshye kubyumva, nubwo byakenera ibitekerezo byinshi…"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers"
msgstr "Ibitabo bifite ishusho ya 300GB+ byarekuwe"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text1"
msgstr "Mu mpera, turishimye gutangaza irekurwa rito. Mu bufatanye n'abantu bakora ku ishami rya Libgen.rs, turasangiza ibitabo byabo byose binyuze muri torrents na IPFS. Ibi bizatuma umutwaro wo kureba ishusho y'ibitabo usaranganywa ku mashini menshi, kandi bizabibika neza. Mu bihe byinshi (ariko si byose), ishusho y'ibitabo irimo mu nyandiko ubwazo, bityo ibi ni nk' \"amakuru akomoka\". Ariko kuyagira muri IPFS biracyari byiza cyane mu mikorere ya buri munsi ya Arikivu ya Anna n'ibindi byiciro bya Library Genesis."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text2"
msgstr "Nk'uko bisanzwe, ushobora kubona iri rekurwa kuri Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: yimuriwe kuri <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Arikivu ya Anna</a>). Ntabwo tuzayihuza hano, ariko urashobora kuyibona byoroshye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text3"
msgstr "Twizere ko dushobora kugabanya umuvuduko wacu gato, ubu dufite uburyo bwiza bwo gusimbuza Z-Library. Uyu mutwaro ntabwo ari mwiza cyane. Niba wifuza gufasha mu gutegura porogaramu, imikorere ya seriveri, cyangwa imirimo yo kubika, ntuzuyaze kutwandikira. Haracyari byinshi <a %(annas_archive)s>bikenewe gukorwa</a>. Murakoze ku bw'inyungu n'ubufasha bwanyu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.signature"
msgstr "- Anna n'itsinda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.title"
msgstr "Arikivu ya Anna yabitse isomero rinini ry'ibitabo by'inkuru zishushanyije ku isi (95TB) — urashobora gufasha kubibika"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.tldr"
msgstr "Isomero rinini ry'ibitabo by'inkuru zishushanyije ku isi ryari rifite ahantu hamwe honyine hashobora guhagarara.. kugeza uyu munsi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.links"
msgstr "<a %(news_ycombinator)s>Ganira kuri Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text1"
msgstr "Isomero rinini ry'ibitabo by'inkuru zishushanyije rishobora kuba iry'ishami runaka rya Library Genesis: Libgen.li. Umuyobozi umwe w'uru rubuga yashoboye gukusanya isomero ry'ibitabo by'inkuru zishushanyije rirenga miliyoni 2, rifite ubunini burenga 95TB. Ariko, bitandukanye n'ibindi bikusanyirizo bya Library Genesis, iri ntiryari riboneka mu buryo bw'ubwinshi binyuze muri torrents. Washoboraga kubona ibi bitabo by'inkuru zishushanyije ku giti cyawe gusa binyuze kuri seriveri ye yihariye yihuta — ahantu hamwe honyine hashobora guhagarara. Kugeza uyu munsi!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text2"
msgstr "Muri iyi nyandiko tuzakubwira byinshi kuri iki gikusanyirizo, no ku bukangurambaga bwacu bwo gushyigikira iyi mirimo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fig1"
msgstr "<q>Dr. Barbara Gordon agerageza kwibagirwa mu isi isanzwe y'isomero…</q>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks"
msgstr "Amashami ya Libgen"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text1"
msgstr "Mbere na mbere, amateka make. Ushobora kumenya Library Genesis ku bw'ikusanyirizo ryabo ry'ibitabo rikomeye. Abantu bake bazi ko abakorera ku bushake ba Library Genesis bashinze indi mishinga, nk'ikusanyirizo rinini ry'ibinyamakuru n'inyandiko zisanzwe, ububiko bwuzuye bwa Sci-Hub (mu bufatanye n'umushinze wa Sci-Hub, Alexandra Elbakyan), kandi koko, ikusanyirizo rinini ry'ibitabo by'inkuru zishushanyije."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text2"
msgstr "Mu gihe runaka, abakozi batandukanye b'ibisobanuro bya Library Genesis baratandukanye, bituma habaho imiterere y'ubu yo kugira amashami atandukanye, yose akomeza kwitwa Library Genesis. Ishami rya Libgen.li rifite byihariye iki gikusanyirizo cy'ibitabo by'inkuru zishushanyije, ndetse n'ikusanyirizo rinini ry'ibinyamakuru (nacyo turimo gukoraho)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration"
msgstr "Ubufatanye"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text1"
msgstr "Kubera ubunini bwacyo, iki gikusanyirizo cyari kimaze igihe kirekire kuri lisiti yacu y'ibyo twifuza, bityo nyuma y'intsinzi yacu mu kubika Z-Library, twerekeje amaso kuri iki gikusanyirizo. Mbere twagikusanyije mu buryo butaziguye, byari ikibazo gikomeye, kuko seriveri yabo itari mu buryo bwiza. Twabonye hafi 15TB muri ubu buryo, ariko byari bigenda buhoro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text2"
msgstr "Amahirwe, twashoboye kuvugana n'umuyobozi w'isomero, wemeye kutwoherereza amakuru yose mu buryo butaziguye, byari byihuse cyane. Byafashe igihe kirenga amezi atandatu kugirango twimure no gutunganya amakuru yose, kandi twari hafi yo gutakaza byose kubera kwangirika kw'ibikoresho, byari kuba bisobanuye gutangira bundi bushya."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text3"
msgstr "Iyi ngorane yatumye twizera ko ari ingenzi kugira aya makuru hanze vuba bishoboka, kugirango ashobore kubikwa ahantu henshi. Turi hafi y'ibyago bibiri by'igihe kibi byo gutakaza iki gikusanyirizo burundu!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection"
msgstr "Urutonde"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text1"
msgstr "Kugenda vuba bivuze ko urutonde ruba rutunganye neza… Reka turebe. Tekereza dufite uburyo bwo kubika amadosiye (mu by'ukuri turimo kubitandukanya mu buryo bwa torrents):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text2"
msgstr "Icyerekezo cya mbere, <code>/repository</code>, ni igice cyubatswe neza muri iki. Icyerekezo iki kirimo ibyo bita “amadirishya y’ibihumbi”: amadirishya afite amadosiye ibihumbi, yanditswe mu buryo bukurikirana muri database. Icyerekezo <code>0</code> kirimo amadosiye afite comic_id 0–999, n'ibindi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text3"
msgstr "Iyi ni gahunda imwe na Library Genesis yakoresheje mu makusanyirizo yayo y'ibitabo by'inkuru n'ibitabo bitari inkuru. Igitekerezo ni uko buri “dir y'ibihumbi” ihinduka torrent mu buryo bwikora igihe yuzuye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text4"
msgstr "Ariko, umukozi wa Libgen.li ntiyigeze akora torrents kuri uru rutonde, bityo amadosiye ibihumbi ashobora kuba atari meza, kandi byatumye habaho \"amadosiye atatunganyijwe\". Aha ni <code>/comics0</code> kugeza <code>/comics4</code>. Byose birimo uburyo bwihariye bwo kubika amadosiye, bwashoboraga kugira akamaro mu gukusanya amadosiye, ariko ubu ntibifite agaciro kuri twe. Amahirwe ni uko metadata ikomeza kwerekeza ku madosiye yose, bityo uburyo bwo kubika ku disiki ntibugira icyo butwaye!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text5"
msgstr "Metadata iboneka mu buryo bwa MySQL database. Iyi irashobora gukururwa ku rubuga rwa Libgen.li, ariko tuzayishyira no muri torrent, hamwe n'ameza yacu yose afite MD5 hashes."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis"
msgstr "Isesengura"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.text1"
msgstr "Iyo ubona 95TB byashyizwe mu bubiko bwawe, uragerageza kumva ibyo birimo… Twakoze isesengura kugira ngo turebe niba twagabanya ingano, nko gukuramo ibisa. Dore bimwe mu byo twabonye:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item1"
msgstr "Ibisa mu buryo bw'inyandiko (ubundi buryo bwo gusoma igitabo kimwe) birashobora gukurwamo, ariko biragoye. Iyo urebye mu buryo bw'intoki mu bitabo by'inkuru twabonye byinshi byari ibinyoma."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item2"
msgstr "Hari ibisa bimwe gusa by'uburyo bwa MD5, bikaba ari ugusesagura, ariko gukuramo ibyo byonyine byatanga umusaruro wa 1% in. Ku gipimo nk'iki ni hafi 1TB, ariko kandi, ku gipimo nk'iki 1TB ntacyo bivuze cyane. Twifuza kutagira icyo twangiza mu buryo bwo kubika amakuru muri iki gikorwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item3"
msgstr "Twabonye byinshi bitari ibitabo, nko filime zishingiye ku bitabo by'inkuru. Ibyo nabyo bisa nko gusesagura, kuko izi filime zibonwa henshi mu bundi buryo. Ariko, twasanze tudashobora gukuramo amadosiye ya filime gusa, kuko hari n'ibitabo by'inkuru <em>by'uburyo bw'ikoranabuhanga</em> byashyizwe kuri mudasobwa, umuntu akabifata akabika nka filime."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item4"
msgstr "Mu by'ukuri, icyo twakuramo cyose mu rutonde cyatuma habaho kuzigama ku gipimo gito. Hanyuma twibuka ko turi abashaka kubika amakuru, kandi abantu bazajya babika ibi nabyo ni abashaka kubika amakuru, bityo, \"UBWOKO KI, GUKURAMO?!\" :)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.text2"
msgstr "Niyo mpamvu tubagezaho urutonde rwose, rutahinduwe. Ni amakuru menshi, ariko twizeye ko hari abantu benshi bazita ku kuyabika."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser"
msgstr "Gutanga inkunga"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text1"
msgstr "Turimo gusohora aya makuru mu bice binini. Torrent ya mbere ni <code>/comics0</code>, twashyize mu dosiye imwe nini ya 12TB .tar. Ibyo ni byiza kuri disiki yawe ikomeye no kuri software ya torrent kuruta amadosiye mato menshi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text2"
msgstr "Mu rwego rwo gusohora ibi, turimo gukora igikorwa cyo gukusanya inkunga. Turashaka gukusanya $20,000 yo kwishyura ibikenewe mu mikorere no mu masezerano kuri uru rutonde, ndetse no gushyigikira imishinga iriho n'iy'ahazaza. Dufite <em>imishinga minini</em> iri mu nzira."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text3"
msgstr "<em>Ni nde nshyigikira n'inkunga yanjye?</em> Mu ncamake: turimo kubika ubumenyi n'umuco w'ikiremwamuntu cyose, no kubigira byoroshye kubibona. Kode zacu zose n'amakuru ni open source, turi umushinga ukorwa n'abakorerabushake gusa, kandi tumaze kubika ibitabo bifite agaciro ka 125TB (uretse torrents za Libgen na Scihub zisanzwe). Mu by'ukuri turimo kubaka uburyo buzafasha kandi bugatera inkunga abantu gushaka, gusoma, no kubika ibitabo byose ku isi. Tuzandika ku mugambi wacu mukuru mu nyandiko y'ahazaza. :)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text4"
msgstr "Niba utanze inkunga y'ubunyamuryango bwa \"Amazing Archivist\" bw'amezi 12 ($780), uzabona <strong>“gutoranya torrent”</strong>, bivuze ko tuzashyira izina ryawe cyangwa ubutumwa mu izina rya dosiye imwe muri torrents!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text5"
msgstr "Urashobora gutanga inkunga ujya kuri <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Ububiko bwa Anna</a> ugakanda kuri buto ya “Tanga inkunga”. Turimo no gushaka abandi bakorerabushake: abahanga mu gukora software, abashakashatsi mu mutekano, abahanga mu bucuruzi butazwi, n'abasemuzi. Ushobora kandi kudushyigikira utanga serivisi zo kwakira. Kandi rwose, nyamuneka shyigikira torrents zacu!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text6"
msgstr "Urakoze kuri buri wese wadushyigikiye mu buryo bw'ubuntu! Muri gukora itandukaniro ry'ukuri."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text7"
msgstr "Dore torrents zasohotse kugeza ubu (turacyarimo gutunganya izindi):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text8"
msgstr "Torrents zose ziraboneka kuri <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Ububiko bwa Anna</a> munsi ya “Datasets” (ntituhashyira ihuriro ry'aho, kugira ngo ihuriro ry'iyi blog ntirikurwe kuri Reddit, Twitter, n'ahandi). Uhereye aho, kanda ku ihuriro ry'urubuga rwa Tor."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next"
msgstr "Ibikurikira ni iki?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text1"
msgstr "Ibice byinshi bya torrents ni byiza kubika igihe kirekire, ariko si byiza cyane kubikoresha buri munsi. Tuzakorana n’abafatanyabikorwa mu kwakira amakuru yose kuri interineti (kuko Igitabo cya Anna kitakira ibikubiyemo byacyo). Birumvikana ko uzashobora kubona izi links zo gukuramo kuri Igitabo cya Anna."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text2"
msgstr "Turimo kandi gutumira buri wese gukora ibintu n’aya makuru! Dufashe kuyasesengura neza, kuyakuraho ibisa, kuyashyira kuri IPFS, kuyavanga, gutoza imashini zawe z’ubwenge n’ayo, n’ibindi. Ni ibyawe byose, kandi ntitwihanganira kubona ibyo uzabikoresha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text3"
msgstr "Mu mpera, nk'uko twabivuze mbere, turacyafite kurekura bikomeye biri imbere (niba <em>umuntu</em> yashobora <em>kubitanga</em> atabishaka <em>ububiko</em> bwa ACS4, murabizi aho mutubona…), kimwe no kubaka uburyo bwo gusubiza inyuma ibitabo byose ku isi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text4"
msgstr "Nuko rero mukomeze mukurikirane, turacyari mu ntangiriro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.signature"
msgstr "- Anna n'itsinda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.title"
msgstr "Ibitabo bishya 3x byongewe kuri Pirate Library Mirror (+24TB, ibitabo miliyoni 3.8)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text1"
msgstr "Mu kurekura kwa mbere kwa Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: bimuriwe kuri <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Arikivu ya Anna</a>), twakoze ishusho ya Z-Library, urutonde runini rw'ibitabo bitemewe. Nk'ibyo twibutsa, ibi ni byo twanditse muri iyo nyandiko y'ibanze:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.q1.text1"
msgstr "Z-Library ni isomero rizwi cyane (kandi ridakurikije amategeko). Bafashe urutonde rwa Library Genesis bakora ubushakashatsi bworoshye. Ku rundi ruhande, babaye abahanga cyane mu gusaba inkunga z’ibitabo bishya, babashishikariza gutanga ibitabo bashyiraho inyungu zitandukanye. Ubu ntibagarura ibi bitabo bishya kuri Library Genesis. Kandi bitandukanye na Library Genesis, ntibakora urutonde rwabo rworoshye kugaragaza, bituma kubika neza bigorana. Ibi ni ingenzi ku buryo bwabo bw’ubucuruzi, kuko basaba amafaranga yo kubona urutonde rwabo mu buryo bwinshi (birenze ibitabo 10 ku munsi)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.q1.text2"
msgstr "Ntidukora imanza z’umuco ku gusaba amafaranga yo kubona urutonde rw’ibitabo ridakurikije amategeko. Nta gushidikanya ko Z-Library yatsinze mu kongera uburyo bwo kubona ubumenyi, no kubona ibitabo byinshi. Turi hano gusa gukora uruhare rwacu: kwemeza kubika igihe kirekire uru rutonde rwihariye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text2"
msgstr "Uru rutonde rwari rwatangiye hagati mu 2021. Mu gihe gito, Z-Library yakomeje kwiyongera ku muvuduko ukabije: bongeyeho ibitabo bishya hafi miliyoni 3.8. Hariho ibisa, rwose, ariko byinshi muri byo bisa n’ibitabo bishya byemewe, cyangwa scans zifite ireme ryiza ry’ibitabo byatanzwe mbere. Ibi biterwa ahanini n’umubare wiyongereye w’abakorerabushake b’abagenzuzi muri Z-Library, n’uburyo bwabo bwo kohereza byinshi hamwe no gukuraho ibisa. Turashaka kubashimira kuri ibi bikorwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text3"
msgstr "Turishimye gutangaza ko twabonye ibitabo byose byongewe kuri Z-Library hagati y’icyitegererezo cyacu cya nyuma na Kanama 2022. Twanasubiye inyuma tukuramo ibitabo bimwe twibagiwe ubwa mbere. Muri rusange, uru rutonde rushya ni hafi 24TB, runini cyane kurusha urwa mbere (7TB). Icyitegererezo cyacu ubu ni 31TB muri rusange. Nanone, twakuraho ibisa na Library Genesis, kuko hari torrents zihari kuri urwo rutonde."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text4"
msgstr "Nyamuneka jya kuri Pirate Library Mirror urebe urutonde rushya (EDIT: yimuriwe kuri <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Igitabo cya Anna</a>). Hariho amakuru menshi ahari ku buryo dosiye ziteye, n’ibyahindutse kuva ubwa nyuma. Ntituzashyiraho link ivuye hano, kuko iyi ari urubuga rwa blog rudakira ibikoresho bidakurikije amategeko."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text5"
msgstr "Birumvikana, gutanga ni uburyo bwiza bwo kudufasha. Murakoze mwese mutanga seti yacu ya torrents. Turashimira igisubizo cyiza, kandi twishimiye ko hari abantu benshi bitaye ku kubika ubumenyi n’umuco muri ubu buryo budasanzwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.signature"
msgstr "- Anna n'itsinda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.title"
msgstr "Uko wabaye umu pirate archivist"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.tldr"
msgstr "Inzitizi ya mbere ishobora kuba itunguranye. Si ikibazo cya tekiniki, cyangwa ikibazo cy’amategeko. Ni ikibazo cy’imitekerereze."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates"
msgstr "Mbere yo kwinjira, amakuru abiri kuri Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: yimuriwe kuri <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Igitabo cya Anna</a>):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates.item1"
msgstr "Twabonye inkunga z’inyabubasha cyane. Iya mbere yari $10k ivuye ku muntu utazwi kandi ushyigikira \"bookwarrior\", washinze Library Genesis. Dushimiye cyane bookwarrior ku gutanga iyi nkunga. Iya kabiri yari indi $10k ivuye ku muterankunga utazwi, waje mu nshuti nyuma y’icyitegererezo cyacu cya nyuma, kandi yatewe inkunga yo gufasha. Twanabonye inkunga ntoya nyinshi. Murakoze cyane ku nkunga yanyu y’inyabubasha. Dufite imishinga mishya ishimishije iri mu nzira izashyigikirwa n’iyi, rero mukomeze mukurikirane."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates.item2"
msgstr "Twagize ibibazo bya tekiniki ku bunini bw’icyitegererezo cyacu cya kabiri, ariko torrents zacu zirahari kandi zirimo gutangwa. Twanabonye itangwa ry’inyabubasha ry’umuntu utazwi wo gutanga urutonde rwacu kuri seriveri zabo zifite umuvuduko mwinshi cyane, bityo turimo gukora upload idasanzwe ku mashini yabo, nyuma yaho abandi bose bakuramo urutonde bagomba kubona umuvuduko mwinshi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text1"
msgstr "Ibitabo byose byanditswe ku <em>impamvu</em> yo kubika ibikoresho bya digitale muri rusange, no kubika pirate by’umwihariko, ariko reka dutange ishusho yihuse ku batarabimenyereye cyane. Isi irimo gukora ubumenyi n’umuco byinshi kurusha mbere, ariko kandi byinshi muri byo biratakara kurusha mbere. Ubumuntu bushingira cyane ku bigo by’ubucuruzi nka ba bandi batanga ibitabo by’ubumenyi, serivisi zo gutanga amashusho, n’ibigo by’imbuga nkoranyambaga kuri iyi mirage, kandi kenshi ntibagaragaje kuba abarinzi beza. Reba filime mbarankuru Digital Amnesia, cyangwa se ikiganiro icyo ari cyo cyose cya Jason Scott."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text2"
msgstr "Hari ibigo bimwe bikora akazi keza ko kubika byinshi bashoboye, ariko babangamiwe n’amategeko. Nk’abapirate, turi mu mwanya wihariye wo kubika urutonde batabasha gukoraho, kubera kubahiriza amategeko y’uburenganzira cyangwa izindi mbogamizi. Dushobora kandi gukora kopi z’urutonde inshuro nyinshi, ku isi hose, bityo tukongera amahirwe yo kubika neza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text3"
msgstr "Kuri ubu, ntituzinjira mu biganiro ku byiza n’ibibi by’uburenganzira bw’ubwenge, umuco wo kurenga ku mategeko, ibitekerezo ku gucunga, cyangwa ikibazo cyo kubona ubumenyi n’umuco. Nibyo byose birangiye, reka twinjire mu <em>uburyo</em>. Tuzasangiza uko itsinda ryacu ryabaye abapirate archivists, n’amasomo twize mu nzira. Hari inzitizi nyinshi iyo utangiye uru rugendo, kandi twizera ko dushobora kugufasha muri zimwe muri zo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community"
msgstr "Umuryango"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text1"
msgstr "Ingorane rya mbere rishobora kuba ritunguranye. Si ikibazo cya tekiniki, cyangwa ikibazo cy’amategeko. Ni ikibazo cy’imitekerereze: gukora uyu murimo mu bwihisho bishobora kuba byonyine cyane. Bitewe n'ibyo uteganya gukora, n'icyo wumva gishobora kugutera ikibazo, ushobora kuba ugomba kwitonda cyane. Ku ruhande rumwe rw'uruhererekane dufite abantu nka Alexandra Elbakyan*, washinze Sci-Hub, uvuga ku mugaragaro ibikorwa bye. Ariko afite ibyago byinshi byo gufatwa niba yasuye igihugu cyo mu burengerazuba muri iki gihe, kandi ashobora gufungwa imyaka myinshi. Ese ni ibyago waba witeguye gufata? Turi ku rundi ruhande rw'uruhererekane; twitonda cyane kugira ngo tudakora ikosa na rimwe, kandi dufite umutekano ukomeye mu mikorere."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text2"
msgstr "* Nk'uko byavuzwe kuri HN na \"ynno\", Alexandra ubusanzwe ntiyashakaga kumenyekana: \"Seriveri ze zari zashyizweho gutanga ubutumwa bw'amakosa burambuye bwa PHP, harimo n'inzira yuzuye y'aho ikosa ryabereye, yari munsi y'ububiko /home/ringo-ring, bushobora gukurikiranywa ku izina yakoresheje kuri interineti ku rubuga rutari urwo, rufitanye isano n'izina rye nyakuri. Mbere y'uko ibi bimenyekana, yari atazwi.\" Bityo, ukoreshe amazina y'abakoresha atandukanye ku mashini ukoresha kuri ibi bintu, mu gihe waba wakoze ikosa mu ishyirwaho ry'ibintu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text3"
msgstr "Ariko, ubwo bwihisho bujyana n'igihombo cy'imitekerereze. Abantu benshi bakunda gushimirwa ku murimo bakora, nyamara ntushobora guhabwa ishimwe iryo ari ryo ryose mu buzima busanzwe. N'ibintu byoroshye bishobora kuba ingorabahizi, nko kuba inshuti zawe zikubaza ibyo umaze iminsi ukora (igihe runaka \"gukina na NAS / homelab yanjye\" birarambirana)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text4"
msgstr "Ni yo mpamvu ari ingenzi cyane gushaka umuryango. Ushobora kugabanya umutekano mu mikorere uganira n'inshuti zawe za hafi cyane, uzi neza ko ushobora kuzigirira icyizere gikomeye. N'ubwo bimeze bityo, witondere gushyira ikintu cyose mu nyandiko, mu gihe baba bagomba gutanga email zabo ku nzego zishinzwe umutekano, cyangwa niba ibikoresho byabo byangiritse mu bundi buryo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text5"
msgstr "Icyiza kurushaho ni ugushaka abandi bajura. Niba inshuti zawe za hafi zishishikajwe no kukujyana, ni byiza! Naho ubundi, ushobora kubona abandi kuri interineti. Birababaje ko ibi bikiri umuryango muto. Kugeza ubu twabonye abandi bake gusa bakora muri uru rwego. Ahantu heza ho gutangirira bisa n'aho ari forums za Library Genesis, na r/DataHoarder. Itsinda rya Archive Team naryo rifite abantu batekereza kimwe, nubwo bakora mu mategeko (n'ubwo hari mu bice bimwe by'amategeko bitazwi neza). Imbuga za \"warez\" n'ibikorwa byo kwiba by'umwuga nabyo bifite abantu batekereza mu buryo bumwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text6"
msgstr "Turafunguye ku bitekerezo ku buryo bwo guteza imbere umuryango no kuganira ku bitekerezo. Wumve ko ushobora kutwandikira kuri Twitter cyangwa Reddit. Ahari dushobora kwakira urubuga cyangwa itsinda ry'ibiganiro. Ikibazo kimwe ni uko ibi bishobora guhita bihagarikwa iyo ukoresheje imbuga zisanzwe, bityo tugomba kubyakira ubwacu. Hari kandi guhuza hagati yo kugira ibi biganiro ku mugaragaro (gushobora kwitabira cyane) no kubigira ibanga (kudatuma \"ibyo tugamije\" bamenya ko tugiye kubasaka). Tuzatekereza kuri ibyo. Tumenyeshe niba wifuza ibi!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects"
msgstr "Imishinga"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.text1"
msgstr "Iyo dukora umushinga, ugira ibyiciro bibiri:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase1"
msgstr "Guhitamo urubuga / filozofiya: Aho ushaka kwibanda, kandi impamvu? Ni izihe mpano zawe zidasanzwe, ubumenyi, n'ibibazo ushobora gukoresha ku nyungu zawe?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase2"
msgstr "Guhitamo intego: Ni iyihe koleksheni runaka uzasubiramo?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase3"
msgstr "Gusaka metadata: Gushyira mu gitabo amakuru yerekeye amadosiye, utabanje kuyamanura (akenshi amadosiye manini cyane)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase4"
msgstr "Guhitamo amakuru: Hashingiwe kuri metadata, kugabanya amakuru y'ingenzi yo kubika ubu. Bishobora kuba byose, ariko akenshi hari uburyo bwiza bwo kuzigama umwanya n'umuyoboro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase5"
msgstr "Gusaka amakuru: Koko gufata amakuru."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase6"
msgstr "Gutanga: Kuyapakira muri torrents, kuyatangaza ahantu, gutuma abantu bayakwirakwiza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.text2"
msgstr "Ibi si ibyiciro byigenga rwose, kandi akenshi amakuru ava mu cyiciro cyo nyuma agutuma usubira mu cyiciro cyo mbere. Urugero, mu gihe usaka metadata ushobora gusanga intego wahisemo ifite uburyo bwo kwirinda burenze ubushobozi bwawe (nko gufunga IP), bityo ugasubira inyuma ugashaka indi ntego."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain"
msgstr "1. Guhitamo urubuga / filozofiya"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text1"
msgstr "Nta kubura ubumenyi n'umuco wo kubika, bishobora kuba byinshi. Ni yo mpamvu akenshi ari byiza gufata akanya ugatekereza ku byo ushobora gutanga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text2"
msgstr "Buri wese afite uburyo butandukanye bwo gutekereza kuri ibi, ariko hari ibibazo ushobora kwibaza:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.why"
msgstr "Kuki wifuza ibi? Ni iki ugira ishyaka? Niba dushobora kubona itsinda ry’abantu bose babika ibintu byihariye bibashishikaje, ibyo byaba bihagije! Uzamenya byinshi kurusha umuntu usanzwe ku byerekeye ibyo ukunda, nko kumenya amakuru y'ingenzi yo kubika, koleksheni nziza n'imiryango yo kuri interineti, n'ibindi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.skills"
msgstr "Ni ubuhe bumenyi ufite ushobora gukoresha ku nyungu zawe? Urugero, niba uri inzobere mu mutekano w’imbere mu murongo, ushobora kubona uburyo bwo gutsinda IP blocks ku ntego z’umutekano. Niba uri mwiza mu gutegura imiryango, noneho ushobora gukusanya abantu bamwe hamwe ku ntego. Birakenewe kumenya gahunda nkeya ariko, niba ari ugukomeza umutekano mwiza w’imikorere muri iki gikorwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.time"
msgstr "Ufite igihe kingana iki kuri ibi? Inama yacu ni ugutangira buhoro buhoro no gukora imishinga minini uko ubimenyera, ariko birashobora kugutwara igihe cyose."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.target"
msgstr "Ni ikihe gice cy'ingenzi cyakwibandwaho? Niba ugiye kumara amasaha X mu kubika ibitabo by'ubujura, ni gute ushobora kubona \"inyungu nyinshi\"?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.thinking"
msgstr "Ni izihe nzira zidasanzwe watekereje kuri ibi? Ushobora kugira ibitekerezo cyangwa inzira zidasanzwe abandi bashobora kuba baracikanywe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text3"
msgstr "Mu gihe cyacu, twitaye cyane ku kubungabunga ubumenyi mu gihe kirekire. Twari tuzi Library Genesis, n'ukuntu yagiye isubirwamo inshuro nyinshi hifashishijwe torrents. Twakundaga iyo gahunda. Hanyuma umunsi umwe, umwe muri twe yagerageje gushaka ibitabo by’ubumenyi muri Library Genesis, ariko ntiyabibona, bituma dushidikanya ku buryo byuzuye koko. Twashakishije ibyo bitabo kuri interineti, tubisanga ahandi hantu, bitera igitekerezo cy’umushinga wacu. N'ubwo tutari tuzi Z-Library, twari dufite igitekerezo cyo kudashaka gukusanya ibyo bitabo byose intoki, ahubwo twibanda ku gusubiramo amatorero ahari, no kubisubiza muri Library Genesis."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target"
msgstr "2. Guhitamo intego"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text1"
msgstr "Noneho, dufite ahantu tureba, ubu ni iyihe koleksheni runaka dusubiramo? Hari ibintu bimwe na bimwe bituma intego iba nziza:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.large"
msgstr "Nini"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.unique"
msgstr "Idasanzwe: itarimo neza n’indi mishinga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.accessible"
msgstr "Igerwaho: ntikoresha inzitizi nyinshi zo kukubuza gukuramo metadata n'ibindi bisobanuro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.insight"
msgstr "Ubumenyi bwihariye: ufite amakuru yihariye kuri iyi ntego, nko kuba ufite uburyo bwihariye bwo kugera kuri iyi koleksheni, cyangwa wamenye uko gutsinda inzitizi zabo. Ibi ntibisabwa (umushinga wacu ugiye kuza ntukora ikintu cyihariye), ariko birafasha!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text2"
msgstr "Igihe twabonaga ibitabo byacu by’ubumenyi ku mbuga zitari Library Genesis, twagerageje kumenya uko byageze kuri interineti. Twaje kubona Z-Library, kandi twumva ko n'ubwo ibitabo byinshi bitaboneka bwa mbere aho, birangira bihageze. Twamenye umubano wayo na Library Genesis, n'uburyo bwo gutanga ibihembo (by'amafaranga) n'uburyo bwiza bwo gukoresha, byombi byatumye iba koleksheni yuzuye cyane. Twakoze ubushakashatsi bwa metadata n'ibindi bisobanuro, kandi twasanga dushobora kwirinda imipaka yo gukuramo IP zabo, dukoresheje uburyo bwihariye bwo kugera ku masezerano menshi ya proxy."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text3"
msgstr "Mu gihe uri kugenzura intego zitandukanye, ni ingenzi cyane guhisha inzira zawe ukoresheje VPNs n'udushya twa email, tuzaganira birambuye nyuma."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata"
msgstr "3. Gukuramo metadata"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text1"
msgstr "Reka tujye mu bumenyi bwisumbuyeho hano. Kugira ngo dukuremo metadata ku mbuga, twagumanye ibintu byoroshye. Dukoresha scripts za Python, rimwe na rimwe curl, na MySQL database kubika ibisubizo. Ntabwo twigeze dukoresha software yihariye yo gukuramo ishobora gushushanya imbuga zigoranye, kuko kugeza ubu twari dukeneye gusa gukuramo impapuro imwe cyangwa ebyiri dukurikije ids no gusoma HTML. Niba nta mapaji yoroshye yo gukuramo, ushobora gukenera umucukumbuzi wuzuye ugerageza kubona impapuro zose."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text2"
msgstr "Mbere yo gutangira gukuramo urubuga rwose, gerageza kubikora intoki gato. Jya ku mapaji make ubwawe, kugira ngo umenye uko bikora. Rimwe na rimwe uzahura n'ibibazo bya IP cyangwa imyitwarire yihariye muri ubu buryo. Ibi ni kimwe no gukuramo ibindi bisobanuro: mbere yo kwinjira cyane muri iyi ntego, menya neza ko ushobora gukuramo neza ibindi bisobanuro byayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text3"
msgstr "Kugira ngo wirinde inzitizi, hari ibintu bimwe ushobora kugerageza. Hariho izindi IP cyangwa amasezerano atanga ibindi bisobanuro ariko ntibifite inzitizi zimwe? Hariho API endpoints zidafite inzitizi, mu gihe izindi zifite? Ni ku muvuduko ki IP yawe ifungwa, kandi igihe kingana iki? Cyangwa ntufunzwe ahubwo uragabanywa? Niba uremye konti y'umukoresha, ibintu bihinduka gute? Ushobora gukoresha HTTP/2 kugira ngo ugumane imiyoboro ifunguye, kandi ibyo byongera umuvuduko wo gusaba impapuro? Hariho impapuro zerekana amadosiye menshi icyarimwe, kandi amakuru ahari ahagije?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text4"
msgstr "Ibintu ushobora gushaka kubika birimo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.title"
msgstr "Umutwe"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.location"
msgstr "Izina ry'ikibanza / aho giherereye"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.id"
msgstr "ID: ishobora kuba ID y'imbere, ariko IDs nka ISBN cyangwa DOI zirafasha cyane."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.size"
msgstr "Ingano: kugirango ubare umwanya w'ububiko ukeneye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.hash"
msgstr "Hash (md5, sha1): kugirango wemeze ko wakuyemo dosiye neza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.dates"
msgstr "Itariki yongeweho/yahinduwe: kugirango ushobore kugaruka nyuma ukuremo amadosiye utigeze ukuramo mbere (n'ubwo ushobora kandi gukoresha ID cyangwa hash kuri ibi)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.notes"
msgstr "Ibisobanuro, icyiciro, tags, abanditsi, ururimi, n'ibindi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text5"
msgstr "Dukunze kubikora mu byiciro bibiri. Ubwa mbere dukuramo amafayili ya HTML y'umwimerere, akenshi tuyashyira muri MySQL (kugira ngo twirinde amafayili mato menshi, ibyo tuzaganiraho hepfo). Hanyuma, mu cyiciro cyihariye, tunyura kuri ayo mafayili ya HTML tukayashyira mu mbonerahamwe za MySQL nyazo. Uko niko utazaba ugomba kongera gukuramo byose uhereye ku ntangiriro niba ubona ikosa muri code yawe yo gusesengura, kuko ushobora kongera gusesengura amafayili ya HTML ukoresheje code nshya. Akenshi kandi biroroshye kugabanya igikorwa cyo gusesengura, bityo ukazigama igihe (kandi ushobora kwandika code yo gusesengura mu gihe scraping iri gukorwa, aho kwandika ibyiciro byombi icyarimwe)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text6"
msgstr "Mu mpera, menya ko kuri bimwe mu ntego gusesengura metadata ari byo gusa bihari. Hari amatsinda manini ya metadata hanze aho atabitswe neza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data"
msgstr "4. Guhitamo amakuru"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text1"
msgstr "Akenshi ushobora gukoresha metadata kugira ngo umenye igice cy'amakuru cyumvikana cyo gukuramo. N'ubwo ushobora kuzashaka gukuramo amakuru yose, birashobora kuba byiza guha agaciro ibikenewe cyane mbere, mu gihe waba ubonetse cyangwa ubwirinzi bwatejwe imbere, cyangwa kuko waba ukeneye kugura disiki nyinshi, cyangwa byoroshye kuko hari ikindi kintu kiza mu buzima bwawe mbere y'uko ushobora gukuramo byose."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text2"
msgstr "Urugero, urutonde rushobora kugira inyandiko nyinshi z'igikoresho kimwe (nka igitabo cyangwa filime), aho imwe yanditse nk'ifite ireme ryiza. Kubika izo nyandiko mbere byaba bifite agaciro. Ushobora kuzashaka kubika inyandiko zose, kuko mu bindi bihe metadata ishobora kuba yanditse nabi, cyangwa hashobora kuba hari ingaruka zitazwi hagati y'inyandiko (urugero, \"inyandiko nziza\" ishobora kuba nziza mu buryo bwinshi ariko mbi mu bundi buryo, nko kuba filime ifite resolution iri hejuru ariko itagira subtitles)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text3"
msgstr "Ushobora kandi gushakisha muri database yawe ya metadata kugira ngo ubone ibintu bishimishije. Ni ikihe kintu kinini cyakiriwe, kandi kuki ari kinini cyane? Ni ikihe kintu gito? Hariho imiterere cyangwa ibiteye amatsiko mu byiciro bimwe, indimi, n'ibindi? Hariho amazina y'ibintu byikubye cyangwa bisa cyane? Hariho imiterere y'igihe amakuru yashyizweho, nko ku munsi umwe aho amafayili menshi yashyizweho icyarimwe? Akenshi ushobora kwiga byinshi urebye dataset mu buryo butandukanye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text4"
msgstr "Mu kibazo cyacu, twakuyemo ibitabo bya Z-Library dukoresheje md5 hashes muri Library Genesis, bityo tukazigama igihe kinini cyo gukuramo no kubika kuri disiki. Ibi ni ibintu byihariye cyane ariko. Mu bindi bihe nta database zose z'ibintu byamaze kubikwa neza n'abajura bagenzi. Ibi ubwabyo ni amahirwe akomeye kuri umuntu uri hanze aho. Byaba byiza kugira ishusho y'ibintu nk'umuziki na filime byamaze gukwirakwizwa cyane ku mbuga za torrent, bityo bikaba bifite umwanya muto wo gushyirwa mu nzu z'abajura."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping"
msgstr "5. Gusesengura amakuru"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text1"
msgstr "Noneho witeguye gukuramo amakuru mu buryo bwinshi. Nk'uko byavuzwe mbere, muri iki gihe ugomba kuba waramaze gukuramo intoki amafayili menshi, kugira ngo umenye neza imikorere n'ibyo intego igena. Ariko, hariho ibitangaza bizagutegereza igihe uzaba uri gukuramo amafayili menshi icyarimwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text2"
msgstr "Inama yacu hano ni ugukomeza ibintu byoroheje. Tangira gusa ukuremo amafayili menshi. Ushobora gukoresha Python, hanyuma ukagura ku mirongo myinshi. Ariko rimwe na rimwe byoroshye cyane ni ugukora amafayili ya Bash uhereye muri database, hanyuma ugakoresha menshi muri windows nyinshi za terminal kugira ngo ugere ku gipimo kinini. Uburyo bwihuse bwa tekiniki bukwiye kuvugwa hano ni ugukoresha OUTFILE muri MySQL, ushobora kwandika aho ariho hose niba ufunze \"secure_file_priv\" muri mysqld.cnf (kandi umenye neza ko ufunze/uhindura AppArmor niba uri kuri Linux)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text3"
msgstr "Tubika amakuru kuri disiki zisanzwe. Tangira n'ibyo ufite, hanyuma ugende wongera buhoro buhoro. Birashobora kuba bikomeye gutekereza ku kubika amagana ya TBs y'amakuru. Niba ari uko bimeze, shyira hanze igice cyiza mbere, kandi mu itangazo ryawe usabe ubufasha mu kubika ibisigaye. Niba ushaka kugura disiki nyinshi ubwawe, r/DataHoarder ifite ibikoresho byiza byo kubona ibiciro byiza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text4"
msgstr "Gerageza kutita cyane ku mashini y'ububiko bwihariye. Biroroshye kugwa mu mwobo wo gushyiraho ibintu nka ZFS. Icyakora, ikintu kimwe cya tekiniki ugomba kumenya ni uko amashini menshi y'ububiko atitwara neza n'amafayili menshi. Twasanze uburyo bworoshye bwo kubikemura ari ugukora amadosiye menshi, urugero ku byiciro bitandukanye by'ID cyangwa hash prefixes."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text5"
msgstr "Nyuma yo gukuramo amakuru, menya neza kugenzura ubuziranenge bw'amafayili ukoresheje hashes muri metadata, niba iboneka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution"
msgstr "6. Gukwirakwiza"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text1"
msgstr "Ufite amakuru, bityo ukaba ufite ishusho ya mbere y'abajura ku isi y'intego yawe (birashoboka). Mu buryo bwinshi igice gikomeye kirarangiye, ariko igice cy'ibyago kiracyari imbere yawe. Nyuma ya byose, kugeza ubu wari wihishe; uguruka munsi y'ibipimo. Icyo wagombaga gukora cyose ni ugukoresha VPN nziza igihe cyose, ntukuzuze amakuru yawe bwite mu nyandiko zose (duh), kandi wenda ukoreshe session yihariye ya browser (cyangwa n'indi mudasobwa)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text2"
msgstr "Noneho ugomba gukwirakwiza amakuru. Mu kibazo cyacu twashakaga kubanza gutanga ibitabo kuri Library Genesis, ariko twahise tubona ingorane muri ibyo (gutondeka ibya fiction vs non-fiction). Bityo twahisemo gukwirakwiza dukoresheje torrents ya Library Genesis. Niba ufite amahirwe yo gutanga umusanzu ku mushinga usanzwe, ibyo bishobora kugukiza igihe kinini. Ariko, ntabwo hariho mirrors y'abajura iteguwe neza muri iki gihe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text3"
msgstr "Noneho reka tuvuge ko wiyemeje gukwirakwiza torrents ubwawe. Gerageza kugira ngo ayo mafayili abe mato, bityo byoroheye kuyashyira ku zindi mbuga. Uzaba ugomba noneho gutanga torrents ubwawe, ukomeza kuguma mu ibanga. Ushobora gukoresha VPN (ufite cyangwa udafite port forwarding), cyangwa ukishyura ukoresheje Bitcoins yanyuze mu nzira z'ibanga kuri Seedbox. Niba utazi icyo ayo magambo amwe asobanura, uzaba ufite byinshi byo gusoma, kuko ari ingenzi ko wumva neza ingaruka z'ibyago hano."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text4"
msgstr "Ushobora kwakira amafayili ya torrent ubwayo ku mbuga za torrent zisanzwe. Mu kibazo cyacu, twahisemo kwakira urubuga, kuko twashakaga kandi gukwirakwiza filozofiya yacu mu buryo bugaragara. Ushobora kubikora ubwawe mu buryo bumwe (dukoresha Njalla ku masosiyete yacu no kwakira, twishyura dukoresheje Bitcoins yanyuze mu nzira z'ibanga), ariko kandi wumve ko ushobora kutwandikira kugira ngo twakire torrents zawe. Turashaka kubaka ishusho y'ibanze y'abajura mu gihe iki gitekerezo cyakirwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text5"
msgstr "Ku bijyanye no guhitamo VPN, byinshi byaranditswe kuri ibi, bityo tuzongera gusa inama rusange yo guhitamo hakurikijwe izina. Politiki z'ukuri z'iburanisha zitagira logs zifite amateka maremare yo kurinda ubuzima bwite ni amahitamo afite ibyago bike, mu bitekerezo byacu. Menya ko n'ubwo ukora byose neza, ntushobora kugera ku byago bya zeru. Urugero, igihe utanga torrents zawe, umukozi w'igihugu ufite ubushake bwinshi ashobora kureba imigendekere y'amakuru yinjira n'iyasohoka kuri seriveri za VPN, kandi akamenya uwo uri we. Cyangwa ushobora gusa gukora ikosa. Twamaze gukora, kandi tuzongera. Amahirwe ni uko, ibihugu ntibikunda <em>ko</em> cyane ubujura."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text6"
msgstr "Icyemezo kimwe cyo gufata kuri buri mushinga, ni ukumenya niba uzawusohora ukoresheje izina risanzwe cyangwa niba utazabikora. Niba ukomeza gukoresha izina rimwe, amakosa mu mutekano w’ibikorwa byakozwe mbere ashobora kugaruka akakugiraho ingaruka. Ariko gusohora ukoresheje amazina atandukanye bivuze ko utubaka izina rirambye. Twahisemo kugira umutekano ukomeye w’ibikorwa kuva ku ntangiriro kugira ngo dukomeze gukoresha izina rimwe, ariko ntituzazuyaza gusohora dukoresheje izina ritandukanye niba twakoze ikosa cyangwa niba ibihe bibisaba."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text7"
msgstr "Kumenyekanisha birashobora kuba ingorabahizi. Nk'uko twabivuze, iki ni igice cyihariye. Mu ntangiriro twatangaje kuri Reddit, ariko byafashe umuvuduko kuri Hacker News. Ubu inama yacu ni ugutangaza ahantu hato hanyuranye ukareba ibizavamo. Kandi nanone, twandikire. Twishimiye gukwirakwiza ijambo ry'ibikorwa by'ububiko bw'abajura."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.conclusion"
msgstr "Umwanzuro"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.conclusion.text1"
msgstr "Twizera ko ibi bifasha abatangizi mu bubiko bw'abajura. Turishimye kubakira muri iyi si, ntuzazuyaze kutwandikira. Reka twirinde ubumenyi n'umuco by'isi uko dushoboye, kandi tubikwirakwize hose."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.signature"
msgstr "- Anna n'itsinda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.title"
msgstr "Dutangaza Ububiko bw'Abajura: Kubika 7TB z'ibitabo (bitari muri Libgen)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text1"
msgstr "Uyu mushinga (EDIT: wimuriwe kuri <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Ububiko bwa Anna</a>) ugamije gutanga umusanzu mu kubika no kubohora ubumenyi bw’abantu. Dutanga umusanzu wacu muto kandi wicishije bugufi, dukurikira intambwe z’abakomeye baturutseho."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text2"
msgstr "Umugambi w'uyu mushinga usobanurwa n'izina ryawo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.pirate"
msgstr "<strong>Umujura</strong> - Tubangamira nkana amategeko y'uburenganzira mu bihugu byinshi. Ibi biduha ubushobozi bwo gukora ikintu ibigo byemewe n'amategeko bidashobora gukora: kwemeza ko ibitabo bikwirakwizwa hose."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.library"
msgstr "<strong>Ububiko</strong> - Nk'ububiko bwinshi, twibanda cyane ku nyandiko zanditse nk'ibitabo. Dushobora kwagura tukagera ku bundi bwoko bw'itangazamakuru mu gihe kizaza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.mirror"
msgstr "<strong>Ikirahure</strong> - Turi ikirahure cy'ububiko busanzwe. Twibanda ku kubika, ntabwo twibanda ku gutuma ibitabo byorohera gushakishwa no gukururwa (kwinjira) cyangwa guteza imbere umuryango munini w’abantu batanga ibitabo bishya (gutanga)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text3"
msgstr "Ububiko bwa mbere twakiriye ni Z-Library. Iyi ni bibliotheke izwi cyane (kandi itemewe n'amategeko). Bafashe ububiko bwa Library Genesis bakabugira bworoshye gushakishwa. Byongeye kandi, babaye abahanga cyane mu gusaba ibitabo bishya, bashishikariza abakoresha batanga ibitabo bashyiraho inyungu zitandukanye. Ubu ntibatanga ibi bitabo bishya kuri Library Genesis. Kandi bitandukanye na Library Genesis, ntibagabanya ububiko bwabo ngo bubikwe hose, ibi bikabuza kubika hose. Ibi ni ingenzi ku buryo bwabo bwo gukora ubucuruzi, kuko basaba amafaranga yo kugera ku bubiko bwabo mu buryo bwinshi (birenze ibitabo 10 ku munsi)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text4"
msgstr "Ntidukora imanza z’umuco ku gusaba amafaranga yo kubona urutonde rw’ibitabo ridakurikije amategeko. Nta gushidikanya ko Z-Library yatsinze mu kongera uburyo bwo kubona ubumenyi, no kubona ibitabo byinshi. Turi hano gusa gukora uruhare rwacu: kwemeza kubika igihe kirekire uru rutonde rwihariye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text5"
msgstr "Twifuza kugutumira gufasha kubika no kubohora ubumenyi bw’abantu ukura no gusakaza torrents zacu. Reba urupapuro rw’umushinga kugira ngo umenye byinshi ku buryo amakuru ateguye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text6"
msgstr "Twifuza kandi cyane kugutumira gutanga ibitekerezo byawe ku mishinga yo gukurikira, n'uburyo bwo kubikora. Hamwe dushobora kugera kuri byinshi. Ibi ni umusanzu muto mu yindi myinshi. Murakoze, ku byo mukora byose."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.signature"
msgstr "- Anna n'itsinda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.footnote"
msgstr "<em>Ntiduhuza n'amafayili kuri iyi blog. Nyamuneka uyishakire ubwawe.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.title"
msgstr "ISBNdb dump, cyangwa Ni Ibitabo Bingahe Bibitswe Iteka?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.tldr"
msgstr "Niba twakora neza gusubiramo amafayili y'ububiko bw'ibinyoma, ni izihe mpuzandengo z'ibitabo byose ku isi twabashije kubika?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text1"
msgstr "Hamwe n'Ububiko bw'Abajura (EDIT: wimuriwe kuri <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Ububiko bwa Anna</a>), intego yacu ni ugufata ibitabo byose ku isi, tukabibika iteka.<sup>1</sup> Hagati ya torrents zacu za Z-Library, na torrents za Library Genesis z'umwimerere, dufite amafayili 11,783,153. Ariko ni angahe, koko? Niba twasubiramo neza ayo mafayili, ni izihe mpuzandengo z'ibitabo byose ku isi twabashije kubika? Twifuza cyane kugira ikintu nk'iki:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.10%"
msgstr "10% o kuzigama umurage wanditse w'ikiremwamuntu iteka ryose"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text2"
msgstr "Kugira ngo tubone ijana ku ijana, dukeneye umubare wose: umubare w'ibitabo byose byigeze gusohoka.<sup>2</sup> Mbere y’uko Google Books ihagarara, umutekinisiye kuri uwo mushinga, Leonid Taycher, <a %(booksearch_blogspot)s>yagerageje kubara</a> uyu mubare. Yaje kuvuga — mu buryo bwo gutebya — ko ari 129,864,880 (“byibuze kugeza ku Cyumweru”). Yabaze uyu mubare akoresheje kubaka urutonde rw'ibitabo byose ku isi. Kubera ibi, yakusanyije datasets zitandukanye hanyuma azihuza mu buryo butandukanye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text3"
msgstr "Mu buryo bwihuse, hari undi muntu wagerageje gushyira mu rutonde ibitabo byose ku isi: Aaron Swartz, umunyabikorwa w'ikoranabuhanga wapfuye na co-founder wa Reddit.<sup>3</sup> Yatangije <a %(youtube)s>Open Library</a> agamije “urupapuro rumwe rwa interineti kuri buri gitabo cyose cyasohotse”, akoresheje amakuru aturuka mu nkomoko nyinshi zitandukanye. Yaje kwishyura igiciro cya nyuma kubera akazi ke ko kubika ibikoresho by'ikoranabuhanga ubwo yaregwaga gukurura mu buryo butemewe inyandiko z’ubushakashatsi, bikamuviramo kwiyahura. Nta gushidikanya, ibi ni bimwe mu mpamvu itsinda ryacu rikoresha amazina y'ibinyoma, kandi tukaba twitwararika cyane. Open Library iracyayoborwa n’abantu b’intwari muri Internet Archive, ikomeza umurage wa Aaron. Tuzagaruka kuri ibi nyuma muri iyi nyandiko."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text4"
msgstr "Mu nyandiko ya blog ya Google, Taycher asobanura bimwe mu bibazo byo kubara uyu mubare. Icya mbere, ni iki kibara nk'igitabo? Hari ibisobanuro bimwe bishoboka:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.copies"
msgstr "<strong>Kopiya z'ibitabo.</strong> Birumvikana ko ibi bidafasha cyane, kuko ari kopi gusa z'ibikoresho bimwe. Byaba byiza niba dushobora kubika inyandiko zose abantu bakora mu bitabo, nk'ibizwi cyane bya Fermat “inyandiko mu mpande”. Ariko, birababaje, ibi bizaguma kuba inzozi z'umuntu ukora mu bubiko."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.works"
msgstr "<strong>“Ibikorwa”.</strong> Urugero “Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets” nk'igitekerezo cy'ubwenge, gikubiyemo amaversion yose yacyo, nk'ubusobanuro butandukanye n'ibisohoka bundi bushya. Ibi ni ibisobanuro bifite akamaro, ariko birashobora kugorana kumenya aho bigarukira. Urugero, dushobora gushaka kubika ubusobanuro butandukanye, nubwo ibisohoka bundi bushya bifite impinduka ntoya bishobora kutaba ingenzi cyane."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.editions"
msgstr "<strong>“Amaversion”.</strong> Hano ubarira buri version yihariye y'igitabo. Niba hari ikintu cyose gitandukanye, nk'igifuniko gitandukanye cyangwa intangiriro itandukanye, kibara nk'amaversion atandukanye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.files"
msgstr "<strong>Amadosiye.</strong> Iyo ukorana n'amasomero y'ibinyabuzima nka Library Genesis, Sci-Hub, cyangwa Z-Library, hari ikindi kintu cyo kwitaho. Hashobora kubaho scan nyinshi z'amaversion amwe. Kandi abantu bashobora gukora amadosiye meza y'ibihari, bakoresheje OCR, cyangwa bakosora impapuro zasomwe ku ruhande. Turashaka kubara aya madosiye nk'amaversion imwe, bisaba metadata nziza, cyangwa gukuraho kopi zisa ukoresheje ingero z'inyandiko."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text5"
msgstr "“Amaversion” asa nk'ibisobanuro bifatika by'ibyo “ibitabo” ari byo. Byoroshye, ibi bisobanuro bikoreshwa no guha nimero yihariye ya ISBN. ISBN, cyangwa International Standard Book Number, ikoreshwa cyane mu bucuruzi mpuzamahanga, kuko yinjijwe mu buryo bwa barcode mpuzamahanga (”International Article Number”). Niba ushaka kugurisha igitabo mu maduka, gikeneye barcode, bityo ukabona ISBN."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text6"
msgstr "Inyandiko ya blog ya Taycher ivuga ko nubwo ISBN ari ingirakamaro, atari rusange, kuko byakiriwe neza gusa mu myaka ya mirongo irindwi, kandi si hose ku isi. Ariko, ISBN niyo yamenyekanye cyane nk'ikimenyetso cy'amaversion y'ibitabo, bityo niyo ntangiriro yacu nziza. Niba dushobora kubona ISBN zose ku isi, tubona urutonde rw'ibitabo bigikeneye kubikwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text7"
msgstr "None, dukura he amakuru? Hari imishinga myinshi iriho yagerageje gukusanya urutonde rw'ibitabo byose ku isi:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.google"
msgstr "<strong>Google.</strong> Nyuma ya byose, bakoze ubu bushakashatsi kuri Google Books. Ariko, metadata yabo ntiboneka mu buryo bw'ubwinshi kandi biragoye kuyikurura."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.openlib"
msgstr "<strong>Open Library.</strong> Nk'uko byavuzwe mbere, iyi niyo ntego yabo yose. Bakusanyije amakuru menshi y'amasomero aturuka mu masomero afatanya n'ububiko bw'igihugu, kandi baracyabikora. Bafite kandi abashinzwe amasomero b'abakorerabushake n'ikipe y'ikoranabuhanga bagerageza gukuraho kopi zisa, no kuyashyira mu byiciro bitandukanye bya metadata. Icyiza kurusha byose, dataset yabo irafunguye rwose. Ushobora kuyikurura <a %(openlibrary)s>uyikurura</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.worldcat"
msgstr "<strong>WorldCat.</strong> Iyi ni urubuga ruyobowe n'umuryango utari uwa leta OCLC, ugurisha sisitemu yo gucunga amasomero. Bakusanya metadata y'ibitabo biva mu masomero menshi, kandi bakayishyira ku rubuga rwa WorldCat. Ariko, banakora amafaranga bagurisha aya makuru, bityo ntiboneka mu buryo bw'ubwinshi. Bafite datasets zimwe z'ubwinshi ziboneka mu bufatanye n'amasomero amwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.isbndb"
msgstr "<strong>ISBNdb.</strong> Iyi niyo nsanganyamatsiko y'iyi blog. ISBNdb ikurura imbuga zitandukanye z'ibitabo, cyane cyane amakuru y'ibiciro, bakayagurisha abacuruzi b'ibitabo, kugira ngo babashe gushyira ibiciro byabo mu buryo buhuye n'isoko. Kuko ISBNs ari rusange muri iki gihe, bubatse neza “urupapuro rwa interineti kuri buri gitabo”."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.ils"
msgstr "<strong>Sisitemu zitandukanye z'amasomero n'ububiko.</strong> Hari amasomero n'ububiko bitarashyizwe mu rutonde no gukusanywa n'ibyo byavuzwe haruguru, akenshi kubera ko adafite ubushobozi buhagije, cyangwa izindi mpamvu zituma badashaka gusangiza amakuru yabo Open Library, OCLC, Google, n'ibindi. Benshi muri aba bafite inyandiko z'ikoranabuhanga ziboneka kuri interineti, kandi akenshi ntabwo zirinzwe neza, bityo niba ushaka gufasha no kwiga byinshi ku bijyanye na sisitemu z'amasomero zidasanzwe, ibi ni intangiriro nziza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text8"
msgstr "Muri iyi nyandiko, turishimye gutangaza isohoka rito (ugereranije n'ibisohoka byacu bya Z-Library byabanje). Twakurura byinshi muri ISBNdb, kandi twashyize amakuru ahari kugira ngo aboneke kuri torrent ku rubuga rwa Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: yimuriwe kuri <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Ububiko bwa Anna</a>; ntituzashyira ihuriro hano, gusa ushobora kubishakisha). Aha ni hafi miliyoni 30.9 z'inyandiko (20GB nka <a %(jsonlines)s>JSON Lines</a>; 4.4GB gzipped). Ku rubuga rwabo bavuga ko bafite inyandiko miliyoni 32.6, bityo dushobora kuba twarabuze zimwe, cyangwa <em>bo</em> bashobora kuba barakoze ikosa. Muri iki gihe, ntituzasangiza neza uko twabikoze — tuzabirekera nk'imyitozo ku musomyi. ;-)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text9"
msgstr "Icyo tuzasangiza ni isesengura ry'ibanze, kugira ngo tugerageze kwegera kubara umubare w'ibitabo ku isi. Twarebye kuri datasets eshatu: iyi dataset nshya ya ISBNdb, isohoka ryacu ry'ibanze rya metadata twakurura muri Z-Library shadow library (irimo Library Genesis), n'ikimenyetso cya Open Library."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text10"
msgstr "Reka dutangire n'imibare y'ibanze:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text11"
msgstr "Muri Z-Library/Libgen na Open Library harimo ibitabo byinshi kurusha ISBNs yihariye. Ese ibi bivuze ko byinshi muri ibyo bitabo bidafite ISBNs, cyangwa metadata ya ISBN irabura gusa? Dushobora gusubiza iki kibazo dukoresheje guhuza byikora bishingiye ku bindi biranga (umwanditsi, umwanditsi, umucapyi, n'ibindi), gukurura andi masoko y'amakuru, no gukuramo ISBNs mu scan z'ibitabo ubwazo (mu gihe cya Z-Library/Libgen)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text12"
msgstr "Ni bangahe muri ayo ma ISBN ari umwihariko? Ibi birasobanurwa neza n'ishusho ya Venn:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text13"
msgstr "Kugira ngo bisobanuke neza:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text14"
msgstr "Twari twatunguwe n'ukuntu bihurira bike! ISBNdb ifite umubare munini w'ISBNs utagaragara muri Z-Library cyangwa Open Library, kandi ni uko bimeze (nubwo ku rugero ruto ariko rukomeye) ku zindi ebyiri. Ibi bizana ibibazo bishya byinshi. Guhuza byikora byafasha gute mu gutagura ibitabo bitari byashyizweho ISBNs? Hariho byinshi byahuzwa bityo bikongera guhura? Nanone, byagenda bite niba twazana dataset ya 4 cyangwa iya 5? Twabona guhura kingana iki icyo gihe?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text15"
msgstr "Ibi bitanga aho dutangirira. Ubu dushobora kureba ISBNs zose zitari muri dataset ya Z-Library, kandi zidahuye n'ibyo mu mirima y'umwanditsi/umwanditsi. Ibyo birashobora kuduha uburyo bwo kubungabunga ibitabo byose ku isi: ubanza gukurura ku rubuga rw'imbere amashusho, hanyuma ukajya mu buzima busanzwe gusoma ibitabo. Ibyo bishobora no guterwa inkunga n'abaturage, cyangwa bigaterwa n'“ibihembo” by'abantu bashaka kubona ibitabo bimwe na bimwe byashyizwe mu ikoranabuhanga. Ibyo byose ni inkuru y'igihe kizaza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text16"
msgstr "Niba ushaka gufasha muri ibi byose — isesengura ryimbitse; gukurura metadata nyinshi; gushaka ibitabo byinshi; OCR’ing y'ibitabo; gukora ibi mu bindi bice (nka za nyandiko, ibitabo by’amajwi, filime, ibiganiro kuri televiziyo, ibinyamakuru) cyangwa no gutanga bimwe muri ibi bisobanuro ku bintu nka ML / imyitozo y'ibimenyetso by'ururimi runini — nyandikira (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text17"
msgstr "Niba wibanda ku isesengura ry'ibisobanuro, turimo gukora ku buryo datasets zacu n'uburyo bwacu biboneka mu buryo bworoshye gukoresha. Byaba byiza niba ushobora gusa gufata noti no gutangira gukina n'ibi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text18"
msgstr "N'ubwo bimeze bityo, niba ushaka gushyigikira iyi mirimo, nyamuneka tekereza gutanga inkunga. Ibi ni ibikorwa by'abakorerabushake gusa, kandi umusanzu wawe utanga itandukaniro rinini. Buri gice gifasha. Ubu dufata inkunga mu ma crypto; reba urupapuro rw'inkunga kuri Archive ya Anna."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.signature"
msgstr "- Anna n'itsinda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn1"
msgstr "1. Kubw'ubusobanuro bwumvikana bwa \"iteka ryose\". ;)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn2"
msgstr "2. Birumvikana, umwandiko w'ubwoko bw'inyandiko z'abantu urenze cyane ibitabo, cyane cyane muri iki gihe. Kubw'iyi nyandiko n'ibisohoka byacu biheruka twibanda ku bitabo, ariko inyungu zacu zirenga kure."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn3"
msgstr "3. Hari byinshi bishobora kuvugwa kuri Aaron Swartz, ariko twashakaga kumuvuga mu ncamake, kuko akina uruhare rw'ingenzi muri iyi nkuru. Uko igihe kigenda, abantu benshi bashobora guhura n'izina rye bwa mbere, kandi bashobora kwinjira mu mwobo w'imbeba ubwabo."

