#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib"
msgstr "Inzu z'ibitabo z'igicucu"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text1"
msgstr "Hari imiryango myinshi ifite intego zisa, n'ibikorwa byihutirwa bisa. Mu by'ukuri, hari inzu z'ibitabo, inzu ndangamurage, laboratwari, ingoro ndangamurage, n'ibindi bigo bishinzwe kubungabunga ubu bwoko. Benshi muri bo bafite inkunga ihagije, itangwa na leta, abantu ku giti cyabo, cyangwa ibigo. Ariko bafite icyuho kinini: sisitemu y'amategeko."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text2"
msgstr "Aha ni ho uruhare rwihariye rw’amasomero y’igitangaza ruri, kandi ni yo mpamvu Anna’s Archive ibaho. Dushobora gukora ibintu ibindi bigo bidashobora gukora. Ubu, si (kenshi) ko dushobora kubika ibikoresho bitemewe kubikwa ahandi. Oya, biremewe ahantu henshi kubaka isomero rifite ibitabo byose, inyandiko, ibinyamakuru, n'ibindi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text3"
msgstr "Ariko ibyo amasomero yemewe akenshi abura ni <strong>ubusugire n'igihe kirekire</strong>. Hariho ibitabo bifite kopi imwe gusa mu isomero ry’ahantu runaka. Hariho inyandiko za metadata zirindwa n'ikigo kimwe. Hariho ibinyamakuru bibitswe gusa kuri microfilm mu isomero rimwe. Amasomero ashobora kugabanyirizwa inkunga, ibigo bishobora guhomba, amasomero ashobora guterwa ibisasu no gutwikwa. Ibi si ibitekerezo gusa — ibi bibaho buri gihe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text4"
msgstr "Icyo dushobora gukora mu buryo bwihariye muri Archive ya Anna ni uguhunika kopi nyinshi z'imirimo, ku rugero runini. Dushobora gukusanya inyandiko, ibitabo, ibinyamakuru, n'ibindi, kandi tukabikwirakwiza mu bwinshi. Ubu dukora ibi binyuze muri torrents, ariko ikoranabuhanga nyirizina ntacyo rihindura kandi rizahinduka mu gihe. Igice cy'ingenzi ni ugukwirakwiza kopi nyinshi ku isi hose. Iyi mvugo y'amezi arenga 200 iracyumvikana:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.quote.the-lost"
msgstr "<em><q>Ibyatakaye ntibishobora kugarurwa; ariko reka dukize ibyasigaye: si mu nzu z'ububiko n'ibikoresho bibitandukanya n'amaso y'abaturage no kubikoresha, mu kubishyira mu mwanda w'igihe, ahubwo ni mu gukuba kopi nyinshi, ku buryo bizaba bitaragerwaho n'impanuka.</q></em><br>— Thomas Jefferson, 1791"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text5"
msgstr "Inyandiko yihuse ku bijyanye n'uburenganzira rusange. Kubera ko Archive ya Anna yibanda ku bikorwa bitemewe mu bice byinshi ku isi, ntitwitaho cyane ingorane z'ibisanzwe biboneka, nko mu bitabo by'uburenganzira rusange. Ibigo byemewe n'amategeko akenshi byita kuri ibyo neza. Ariko, hari ibitekerezo bituma rimwe na rimwe dukora ku ngorane z'ibisanzwe biboneka:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.metadata"
msgstr "Amakuru ya metadata ashobora kurebwa ku rubuga rwa Worldcat, ariko ntashobora gukururwa mu bwinshi (kugera igihe twabikururaga <a %(worldcat_scrape)s>scraped</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.github"
msgstr "Code ishobora kuba open source kuri Github, ariko Github yose ntishobora kugaragara byoroshye bityo ikabikwa (nubwo muri iki gihe hari kopi zihagije z'ibyinshi mu bigega bya code)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.reddit"
msgstr "Reddit ni ubuntu gukoresha, ariko vuba aha yashyizeho ingamba zikomeye zo kurwanya gukurura amakuru, bitewe n'inyota y'amakuru ya LLM (ibindi kuri ibyo nyuma)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies"
msgstr "Kuba kopi nyinshi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies.text1"
msgstr "Dusubiye ku kibazo cyacu cy'ibanze: ni gute twakwemeza ko tuzabika ibitabo byacu iteka? Ikibazo nyamukuru hano ni uko ibitabo byacu byagiye <a %(torrents_stats)s>byiyongera</a> ku muvuduko mwinshi, binyuze mu gukurura no gufungura amwe mu makusanyirizo manini (hejuru y'akazi keza kamaze gukorwa n'amasomero y'amakuru afunguye nka Sci-Hub na Library Genesis)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies.text2"
msgstr "Uku kwiyongera kw'amakuru bituma bigorana ko amakusanyirizo asubirwamo ku isi hose. Kubika amakuru birahenze! Ariko turizera, cyane cyane iyo turebye izi ngingo eshatu zikurikira."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit"
msgstr "1. Twatoraguye imbuto zimanitse hasi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit.text1"
msgstr "Iyi ikurikira neza ku byihutirwa twavuze haruguru. Twifuza gukorera ku makusanyirizo manini mbere. Ubu ko twamaze kubona amwe mu makusanyirizo manini ku isi, dutegereje ko ukwiyongera kwacu kuzagenda gahoro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit.text2"
msgstr "Haracyari urutonde rurerure rw'amakusanyirizo mato, kandi ibitabo bishya birasuzumwa cyangwa bigasohoka buri munsi, ariko umuvuduko ushobora kugenda gahoro. Dushobora gukuba kabiri cyangwa gatatu mu bunini, ariko mu gihe kirekire."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage"
msgstr "2. Igiciro cyo kubika gikomeza kugabanuka cyane"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text1"
msgstr "Mu gihe cyo kwandika, <a %(diskprices)s>ibiciro by'ibikoresho</a> kuri TB biri hafi $12 ku bikoresho bishya, $8 ku bikoresho byakoreshejwe, na $4 ku mpapuro. Niba turi abirinda kandi tukareba gusa ku bikoresho bishya, bivuze ko kubika petabyte bihagaze hafi $12,000. Niba twibwira ko isomero ryacu rizikuba gatatu kuva kuri 900TB kugeza kuri 2.7PB, byaba bivuze $32,400 kugira ngo dusubiremo isomero ryacu ryose. Kongeraho amashanyarazi, igiciro cy'ibindi bikoresho, n'ibindi, reka tubihuze kuri $40,000. Cyangwa ku mpapuro hagati ya $15,000–$20,000."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text2"
msgstr "Ku ruhande rumwe <strong>$15,000–$40,000 ku bumenyi bwose bw'abantu ni igiciro gito</strong>. Ku rundi ruhande, birahenze gutegereza kopi nyinshi zuzuye, cyane cyane niba twifuza ko abo bantu bakomeza gusakaza torrents zabo ku nyungu z'abandi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text3"
msgstr "Ibyo ni uyu munsi. Ariko iterambere rirakomeza imbere:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text4"
msgstr "Ibiciro by'ibikoresho kuri TB byaragabanutse hafi kimwe cya gatatu mu myaka 10 ishize, kandi bizakomeza kugabanuka ku muvuduko nk'uwo. Impapuro zigaragara ko ziri mu nzira imwe. Ibiciro bya SSD biragabanuka cyane, kandi bishobora gufata ibiciro bya HDD bitarenze mu mpera z'iki kinyejana."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.hdd-prices"
msgstr "Imigendekere y'ibiciro bya HDD iturutse ku masoko atandukanye (kanda urebe ubushakashatsi)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text5"
msgstr "Niba ibi bikomeza, mu myaka 10 dushobora kuba tureba gusa $5,000–$13,000 kugira ngo dusubiremo amakusanyirizo yacu yose (1/3), cyangwa n'ibiri munsi niba twiyongera mu bunini. Nubwo ari amafaranga menshi, bizashoboka kuri benshi. Kandi bishobora kuba byiza kurushaho kubera ingingo ikurikira…"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density"
msgstr "3. Guhinduka mu bushobozi bwo kubika amakuru"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text1"
msgstr "Ubu tubika ibitabo mu buryo bw'ibanze tubihabwa. Yego, birakomatanyijwe, ariko akenshi biracyari amafoto manini cyangwa amafoto y'impapuro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text2"
msgstr "Kugeza ubu, amahitamo yonyine yo kugabanya ubunini bwose bw'amakusanyirizo yacu yari binyuze mu gukomatanya cyane, cyangwa kugabanya kopi. Ariko, kugira ngo tubone kuzigama zikomeye, byombi birahomba cyane ku bwacu. Gukomatanya cyane amafoto bishobora gutuma inyandiko itagisomeka. Kandi kugabanya kopi bisaba icyizere cyinshi ko ibitabo ari bimwe neza, bikunze kuba bitari byo, cyane cyane niba ibikubiyemo ari bimwe ariko amafoto yarafashwe ku bihe bitandukanye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text3"
msgstr "Buri gihe habayeho amahitamo ya gatatu, ariko ubuziranenge bwayo bwari bubi cyane ku buryo tutigeze tuyatekerezaho: <strong>OCR, cyangwa Optical Character Recognition</strong>. Ubu ni uburyo bwo guhindura amafoto mu nyandiko isanzwe, ukoresheje AI kumenya inyuguti ziri mu mafoto. Ibikoresho kuri ibi byahozeho igihe kirekire, kandi byari byiza cyane, ariko \"byiza cyane\" ntibihagije ku mpamvu zo kubika."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text4"
msgstr "Ariko, vuba aha, ibimenyetso byimbitse by'imikorere myinshi byateye imbere cyane, nubwo bigihenze cyane. Twiteze ko ubwizerwe n'igiciro bizagenda byiyongera cyane mu myaka iri imbere, ku buryo bizaba bishoboka kubishyira ku isomero ryacu ryose."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.ocr"
msgstr "Guhindura OCR."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text5"
msgstr "Iyo bibaye, birashoboka ko tuzakomeza kubika amadosiye y'umwimerere, ariko kandi dushobora kugira verisiyo ntoya cyane y'ububiko bwacu abantu benshi bazashaka kwigana. Icy'ingenzi ni uko inyandiko y'umwimerere ubwayo yikubira neza kurushaho, kandi byoroshye cyane kuyikuraho, biduha kuzigama kurushaho."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text6"
msgstr "Muri rusange, si ibintu bidashoboka gutegereza kugabanuka byibuze inshuro 5-10 ku bunini bw'amadosiye yose, bishobora no kurenga. N'ubwo byagabanuka inshuro 5 gusa, twaba tureba <strong>$1,000–$3,000 mu myaka 10 n'ubwo ububiko bwacu bwikuba gatatu</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window"
msgstr "Igihe cy'ingenzi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text1"
msgstr "Niba ibi bitekerezo ari ukuri, <strong>dukeneye gusa gutegereza imyaka ibiri</strong> mbere y'uko ububiko bwacu bwose buzaba bwiganywe hose. Bityo, mu magambo ya Thomas Jefferson, “bikaba bitaragerwaho n'impanuka.”"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text2"
msgstr "Birababaje, itangira rya LLMs, n'imyitozo yazo isaba amakuru menshi, byatumye benshi mu bafite uburenganzira ku byanditswe bashyira ingufu mu kwirwanaho. Birenze uko byari bisanzwe. Imbuga nyinshi ziri kugora gukuramo no kubika, imanza zirimo kugenda, kandi mu gihe kimwe amasomero n'ububiko bw'inyandiko biracyirengagizwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text3"
msgstr "Dushobora gusa gutegereza ko izi miterere zikomeza kuba mbi, kandi ibihangano byinshi bikazimira mbere y'uko byinjira mu ruhame."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text4"
msgstr "<strong>Turi ku mugoroba w'impinduramatwara mu kubika, ariko <q>ibyatakaye ntibishobora kugarurwa.</q></strong> Dufite igihe cy'ingenzi cy'imyaka 5-10 aho bikiri bihenze gukora isomero ryo mu gicucu no gukora kopi nyinshi ku isi, kandi aho kugera kuri byo bitarafungwa burundu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text5"
msgstr "Niba dushobora kwambuka iki gihe, tuzaba twarahambye ubumenyi n'umuco w'ikiremwamuntu iteka ryose. Ntitugomba gutakaza iki gihe. Ntitugomba kurekera iki gihe cy'ingenzi ngo kiducike."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text6"
msgstr "Reka tugende."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.signature"
msgstr "- Anna n'itsinda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.title"
msgstr "Kwinjira byihariye ku masosiyete ya LLM ku isomero rinini ry'ibitabo bitari inkuru mu Bushinwa ku isi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.subtitle"
msgstr "<a %(duxiu_exclusive_chinese)s>Verisiyo y'Igishinwa 中文版</a>, <a %(news_ycombinator)s>Jya impaka kuri Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.tldr"
msgstr "<em><strong>Mu ncamake:</strong> Igitabo cya Anna cyabonye isomero ryihariye ry'ibitabo bitari inkuru mu Bushinwa bingana na miliyoni 7.5 / 350TB — rinini kurusha Library Genesis. Twiteguye guha isosiyete ya LLM uburenganzira bwihariye, mu gusimbuza OCR nziza no gukuramo inyandiko.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text1"
msgstr "Iyi ni inyandiko ngufi ya blog. Turashaka isosiyete cyangwa ikigo kidufasha mu gusimbuza OCR no gukuramo inyandiko ku isomero rinini twabonye, mu gusimbuza uburenganzira bwihariye bwo kwinjira hakiri kare. Nyuma y'igihe cyo kubika, tuzashyira hanze isomero ryose."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text2"
msgstr "Inyandiko y'ubumenyi y'ubuziranenge ni ingenzi cyane mu myitozo ya LLMs. N'ubwo isomero ryacu ari Igishinwa, ibi bikwiye no kuba byiza mu myitozo ya LLMs y'Icyongereza: ibimenyetso bisa n'ibifata ibitekerezo n'ubumenyi hatitawe ku rurimi rw'inkomoko."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text3"
msgstr "Kubw'ibi, inyandiko igomba gukurwa mu bisikana. Igitabo cya Anna kibona iki muri byo? Gushakisha inyandiko yose mu bitabo ku bakoresha bacyo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text4"
msgstr "Kubera ko intego zacu zihuye n'iz'abakora LLM, turashaka umufatanyabikorwa. Twiteguye kuguha <strong>uburenganzira bwihariye bwo kwinjira hakiri kare kuri iri somero mu buryo bwinshi mu gihe cy'umwaka 1</strong>, niba ushobora gukora neza OCR no gukuramo inyandiko. Niba witeguye gusangira kode yose y'umurongo wawe natwe, twiteguye kubika isomero igihe kirekire."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages"
msgstr "Urupapuro rw'icyitegererezo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages.text1"
msgstr "Kugira ngo utwereke ko ufite uburyo bwiza, dore zimwe mu mpapuro z'icyitegererezo zo gutangiriraho, zivuye mu gitabo ku byerekeye superconductors. Uburyo bwawe bugomba gucunga neza imibare, imbonerahamwe, amashusho, inyandiko z'epfo, n'ibindi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages.text2"
msgstr "Ohereza impapuro zawe zateguwe kuri email yacu. Niba zisa neza, tuzakohereza izindi mu ibanga, kandi twiteze ko uzashobora gukoresha uburyo bwawe bwihuse kuri izo nazo. Nitumara kunyurwa, dushobora kugirana amasezerano."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection"
msgstr "Urutonde"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text1"
msgstr "Amakuru menshi ku isomero. <a %(duxiu)s>Duxiu</a> ni isomero rinini ry'ibitabo byasikanywe, ryakozwe na <a %(chaoxing)s>Itsinda rya SuperStar Digital Library</a>. Byinshi ni ibitabo by'ubumenyi, byasikanywe kugira ngo biboneke mu buryo bw'ikoranabuhanga ku mashuri makuru n'amasomero. Ku bakoresha Icyongereza, <a %(library_princeton)s>Princeton</a> na <a %(guides_lib_uw)s>University of Washington</a> bafite ibisobanuro byiza. Hari kandi inkuru nziza itanga amakuru menshi: <a %(doi)s>“Digitizing Chinese Books: A Case Study of the SuperStar DuXiu Scholar Search Engine”</a> (shakisha mu gitabo cya Anna)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text2"
msgstr "Ibitabo byo muri Duxiu bimaze igihe byaribwe ku rubuga rw'Abashinwa. Akenshi bigurishwa n'abacuruzi ku giciro kiri munsi y'idolari. Bikunze gukwirakwizwa hifashishijwe ikintu cy'Abashinwa cyenda gusa na Google Drive, cyakunze kwibwa kugira ngo cyongererwe umwanya wo kubikamo ibintu byinshi. Ibindi bisobanuro by'ikoranabuhanga birambuye biraboneka <a %(github_duty_machine)s>aha</a> na <a %(github_821_github_io)s>aha</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text3"
msgstr "Nubwo ibitabo byakwirakwijwe mu buryo butari bwose, biragoye cyane kubibona mu buryo bwinshi. Twari dufite iki kintu ku rutonde rw'ibyo tugomba gukora, kandi twahaye amezi menshi y'akazi k'igihe cyose. Ariko, vuba aha umufasha w'igitangaza, w'umuhanga, kandi w'umuhanga yatwegereye, atubwira ko yakoze aka kazi kose — ku giciro kinini. Yadusangije urutonde rwose, atiteze ikintu na kimwe mu gusubiza, uretse gusa icyizere cyo kubika igihe kirekire. Biratangaje rwose. Bemeye gusaba ubufasha muri ubu buryo kugira ngo urutonde rube rwakorewe OCR."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text4"
msgstr "Urutonde rugizwe n'imfashanyigisho 7,543,702. Ibi birenze Library Genesis idafite ibitabo by'ubumenyi (biri hafi miliyoni 5.3). Ingano y'ubunini bwose ni hafi 359TB (326TiB) mu buryo bwayo bw'ubu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text5"
msgstr "Turafunguye ku bindi bitekerezo n'ibitekerezo. Twandikire gusa. Reba Inyandiko za Anna kugira ngo umenye byinshi ku bijyanye n'ibitabo byacu, ibikorwa byo kubika, n'uburyo ushobora gufasha. Murakoze!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.signoff"
msgstr "- Anna n'itsinda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.zlib-on-ipfs.deprecated"
msgstr "Icyitonderwa: iyi nyandiko ya blog yarahagaritswe. Twafashe umwanzuro ko IPFS itariteguye gukorerwa igihe. Tuzakomeza guhuza amadosiye kuri IPFS kuva kuri Anna’s Archive igihe bishoboka, ariko ntituzayakira ubwacu ukundi, kandi ntitunashishikariza abandi gukoresha IPFS. Nyamuneka reba urupapuro rwacu rwa Torrents niba ushaka gufasha kubika amakusanyirizo yacu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.zlib-on-ipfs.title"
msgstr "Fasha gukwirakwiza Z-Library kuri IPFS"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.title"
msgstr "Uko wakora isomero ryo mu bwihisho: ibikorwa muri Inyandiko za Anna"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tldr"
msgstr "Nta <q>AWS ku miryango itanga ubufasha mu bwihisho,</q> none se dukora dute Inyandiko za Anna?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text1"
msgstr "Ndi gukoresha <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Inyandiko za Anna</a>, moteri nini ku isi y'ubushakashatsi itari iy'ubucuruzi ku masomero yo mu bwihisho, nka Sci-Hub, Library Genesis, na Z-Library. Intego yacu ni ugutuma ubumenyi n'umuco biboneka byoroshye, kandi mu buryo bw'igihe kirekire kubaka umuryango w'abantu bafatanya kubika no kubungabunga <a %(blog_isbndb_dump_how_many_books_are_preserved_forever)s>ibitabo byose byo ku isi</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text2"
msgstr "Muri iyi nyandiko nderekana uko dukoresha uru rubuga, n'ibibazo byihariye bijyana no gukoresha urubuga rufite imiterere y'amategeko itazwi neza, kuko nta \"AWS ku miryango itanga ubufasha mu bwihisho\"."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text3"
msgstr "<em>Reba kandi inyandiko y'umuvandimwe <a %(blog_how_to_become_a_pirate_archivist)s>Uko waba umubitsi w'ibintu byibwe</a>.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens"
msgstr "Ikarita z'udushya"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text1"
msgstr "Reka dutangire n'ikoranabuhanga ryacu. Ni nkana risa n'iryo abantu basanzwe bamenyereye. Dukoresha Flask, MariaDB, na ElasticSearch. Ibyo ni byo gusa. Gushakisha ni ikibazo cyakemutse cyane, kandi ntitugamije kugihanga bushya. Uretse ibyo, tugomba gukoresha <a %(mcfunley)s>ikarita z'udushya</a> ku bindi: kutavanwa ku rubuga n'inzego z'ubuyobozi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text2"
msgstr "None se Inyandiko za Anna zemewe cyangwa ntizemewe mu buryo ki? Ibi biterwa cyane n'ubuyobozi bw'amategeko. Ibihugu byinshi byemera uburyo runaka bw'uburenganzira bw'umwanditsi, bivuze ko abantu cyangwa amasosiyete bahabwa uburenganzira bwihariye ku bwoko runaka bw'ibikorwa mu gihe runaka. Ku ruhande rwacu, muri Inyandiko za Anna twemera ko nubwo hari inyungu zimwe, muri rusange uburenganzira bw'umwanditsi ni igihombo ku muryango — ariko ibyo ni inkuru y'igihe kizaza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text3"
msgstr "Uburenganzira bwihariye ku bikorwa runaka bivuze ko bitemewe ku muntu uwo ari we wese uri hanze y'uburenganzira bwihariye gukwirakwiza ibyo bikorwa — harimo natwe. Ariko Inyandiko za Anna ni moteri y'ubushakashatsi itakwirakwiza ibyo bikorwa mu buryo butaziguye (byibuze si ku rubuga rwacu rwa clearnet), bityo se twaba turi mu mahoro, si byo? Si byo neza neza. Mu bihugu byinshi bitemewe gusa gukwirakwiza ibikorwa byanditsweho uburenganzira, ariko no guhuza n'ahantu habikora. Urugero rw'ibanze ni itegeko rya DMCA ry'Amerika."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text4"
msgstr "Iryo ni iherezo rikomeye ry'urugero. Ku rundi ruhande rw'urugero hashobora kubaho ibihugu bitagira amategeko y'uburenganzira bw'umwanditsi na gato, ariko ibi ntibibaho koko. Buri gihugu hafi ya cyose gifite uburyo runaka bw'amategeko y'uburenganzira bw'umwanditsi mu bitabo. Gushyira mu bikorwa ni indi nkuru. Hari ibihugu byinshi bifite guverinoma zitita ku gushyira mu bikorwa amategeko y'uburenganzira bw'umwanditsi. Hari kandi ibihugu biri hagati y'ibi byombi, bibuza gukwirakwiza ibikorwa byanditsweho uburenganzira, ariko ntibibuza guhuza n'ibyo bikorwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text5"
msgstr "Ikindi kintu cyo kwitondera ni ku rwego rw'ikigo. Niba ikigo gikora mu gihugu kitita ku burenganzira bw'umwanditsi, ariko ikigo ubwacyo kititeguye gufata ingaruka, gishobora gufunga urubuga rwawe igihe cyose hari uwitotomba kuri byo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text6"
msgstr "Amaherezo, ikintu kinini cyo kwitaho ni ubwishyu. Kubera ko dukeneye kuguma mu ibanga, ntidushobora gukoresha uburyo busanzwe bwo kwishyura. Ibi bidusigira cryptocurrencies, kandi ni igice gito cy'ibigo bishyigikira ibyo (hari amakarita ya debit yishyurwa na crypto, ariko akenshi ntibyakirwa)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture"
msgstr "Imiterere ya sisitemu"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text1"
msgstr "None reka tuvuge ko wabonye ibigo bimwe byiteguye kwakira urubuga rwawe batagufunze — reka tubyite “abatanga serivisi bakunda ubwigenge” 😄. Uzabona vuba ko kwakira byose hamwe na bo bihenda cyane, bityo ushobora gushaka “abatanga serivisi bahendutse” no gukora kwakira nyirizina aho, unyuze mu batanga serivisi bakunda ubwigenge. Niba ubikoze neza, abatanga serivisi bahendutse ntibazigera bamenya ibyo wakiriye, kandi ntibazigera babona ibirego."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text2"
msgstr "N'aba batanga serivisi bose hariho ibyago byo kugufunga, bityo ukeneye kandi ubusugire. Dukeneye ibi ku nzego zose z'ububiko bwacu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text3"
msgstr "Ikigo kimwe gikunze ubwigenge cyashyizeho umwanya wacyo ni Cloudflare. Bafite <a %(blog_cloudflare)s>impaka</a> ko atari abatanga serivisi yo kwakira, ahubwo ari serivisi, nk'uko ISP iri. Bityo ntibagengwa na DMCA cyangwa ibindi bisabwa byo gukuraho, kandi bohereza ibyo basabwa ku mutanga serivisi wawe nyirizina. Bageze kure mu rukiko kugira ngo barinde iyi gahunda. Bityo dushobora kubakoresha nk'urundi rwego rwo kubika no kurinda."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text4"
msgstr "Cloudflare ntikoresha ubwishyu butazwi, bityo dushobora gukoresha gusa gahunda yabo y'ubuntu. Ibi bivuze ko tudashobora gukoresha uburyo bwabo bwo kugabanya umutwaro cyangwa imikorere y'ubufasha. Kubera iyo mpamvu <a %(annas_archive_l255)s>twabikoze ubwacu</a> ku rwego rwa domain. Ku ipaji y'umutwaro, umukozi w'urubuga azagenzura niba domain iriho ikiriho, kandi niba itariho, izahindura URL zose ku yindi domain. Kubera ko Cloudflare ibika impapuro nyinshi, ibi bivuze ko umukozi ashobora kugera ku domain yacu nyamukuru, nubwo seriveri y'ubusuwisi yaba itariho, hanyuma ku kanda gikurikira akajyanwa ku yindi domain."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text5"
msgstr "Turacyafite kandi ibibazo bisanzwe by'imikorere byo guhangana nabyo, nko kugenzura ubuzima bwa seriveri, kwandika amakosa y'imbere n'inyuma, n'ibindi. Imiterere yacu y'ubufasha ituma habaho gukomera kurushaho kuri uru rwego kandi, urugero, ku gukoresha itsinda ritandukanye rwose rya seriveri kuri imwe muri domain. Dushobora no gukoresha verisiyo zishaje z'ikode na datasets kuri iyi domain itandukanye, mu gihe ikosa rikomeye muri verisiyo nyamukuru ritabonetse."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text6"
msgstr "Dushobora kandi kwirinda ko Cloudflare iduhindukirana, tuyikuraho kuri rumwe mu mbuga, nko kuri uru rubuga rutandukanye. Hari uburyo butandukanye bwo gukoresha izi ngamba."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools"
msgstr "Ibikoresho"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text1"
msgstr "Reka turebe ibikoresho dukoresha kugira ngo tugere kuri ibi byose. Ibi biragenda bihinduka uko duhura n’ibibazo bishya kandi tugashaka ibisubizo bishya."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.app"
msgstr "Seriveri y'ibisabwa: Flask, MariaDB, ElasticSearch, Docker."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.proxy"
msgstr "Seriveri y'ubusumbane: Varnish."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.management"
msgstr "Kugenzura seriveri: Ansible, Checkmk, UFW."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.dev"
msgstr "Iterambere: Gitlab, Weblate, Zulip."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.onion"
msgstr "Gushyira ku rubuga rwa Onion: Tor, Nginx."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text2"
msgstr "Hari ibyemezo bimwe na bimwe twagiye dusubiramo. Kimwe ni itumanaho hagati ya seriveri: twakoresheje Wireguard kuri ibi, ariko twasanze rimwe na rimwe ihagarika kohereza amakuru yose, cyangwa ikohereza amakuru mu cyerekezo kimwe gusa. Ibi byabaye kuri gahunda zitandukanye za Wireguard twagerageje, nko kuri <a %(github_costela_wesher)s>wesher</a> na <a %(github_k4yt3x_wg_meshconf)s>wg-meshconf</a>. Twanagerageje gucisha imiyoboro kuri SSH, dukoresheje autossh na sshuttle, ariko twahuye n’<a %(github_sshuttle)s>ibibazo aho</a> (nubwo bitaransobanukira neza niba autossh ifite ibibazo bya TCP-over-TCP cyangwa se — birasa nk'aho ari igisubizo kitari cyiza ariko wenda ni byiza?)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text3"
msgstr "Ahubwo, twasubiye inyuma ku guhuza seriveri mu buryo butaziguye, duhisha ko seriveri ikora ku batanga serivisi bahendutse dukoresheje IP-filtering na UFW. Ibi bifite inenge y’uko Docker idakora neza na UFW, keretse ukoresheje <code>network_mode: \"host\"</code>. Ibi byose birashobora kugira amakosa menshi, kuko uzashyira seriveri yawe ku murongo wa interineti n’ikosa rito cyane mu myandikire. Wenda twakongera gusubira kuri autossh — ibitekerezo byanyu birakenewe hano."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text4"
msgstr "Twagiye dusubiramo kandi Varnish na Nginx. Ubu dukunda Varnish, ariko ifite utubazo n’uducogocogo. Ibyo ni nako bimeze kuri Checkmk: ntituyikunda cyane, ariko irakora ubu. Weblate irakora neza ariko si igitangaza — rimwe na rimwe ndatinya ko izatakaza amakuru yanjye igihe cyose ngerageza kuyihuza na git repo yacu. Flask yagenze neza muri rusange, ariko ifite utubazo tw’amayobera twatwaye igihe kinini gukemura, nko gushyiraho imbuga zihariye, cyangwa ibibazo bijyanye na SqlAlchemy yayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text5"
msgstr "Kugeza ubu ibindi bikoresho byagenze neza: nta bibazo bikomeye dufite kuri MariaDB, ElasticSearch, Gitlab, Zulip, Docker, na Tor. Ibi byose byagize ibibazo bimwe, ariko nta na kimwe gikomeye cyane cyangwa gitwara igihe kinini."

