#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.books-on-ipfs.title"
msgstr "Gushyira ibitabo 5,998,794 kuri IPFS"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.books-on-ipfs.deprecated"
msgstr "Icyitonderwa: iyi nyandiko ya blog yarahagaritswe. Twafashe umwanzuro ko IPFS itariteguye gukorerwa igihe. Tuzakomeza guhuza amadosiye kuri IPFS kuva kuri Anna’s Archive igihe bishoboka, ariko ntituzayakira ubwacu ukundi, kandi ntitunashishikariza abandi gukoresha IPFS. Nyamuneka reba urupapuro rwacu rwa Torrents niba ushaka gufasha kubika amakusanyirizo yacu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.tldr"
msgstr "<em><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Anna’s Archive yakuyeho byose muri WorldCat (ikusanyirizo rinini ry’isi rya metadata y’amasomero) kugira ngo ikore urutonde rwa TODO rw’ibitabo bigomba kubikwa.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text1"
msgstr "Umwaka ushize, twaratangiye <a %(blog)s>gusubiza</a> iki kibazo: <strong>Ni izihe mpuzandengo z'ibitabo byabitswe burundu n'amasomero y'igitangaza?</strong>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text2"
msgstr "Igihe igitabo kigeze mu isomero ry’igitangaza rifunguye nk' <a %(wikipedia_library_genesis)s>Library Genesis</a>, kandi ubu <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>, gihita gikwirakwizwa ku isi yose (binyuze muri torrents), bityo kikabikwa burundu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text3"
msgstr "Kugira ngo dusubize ikibazo cy'izi mpuzandengo z'ibitabo byabitswe, dukeneye kumenya umubare w'ibitabo bihari byose? Kandi byiza ni uko tutagira umubare gusa, ahubwo dufite metadata nyirizina. Bityo ntituzabasha gusa kubihuza n'amasomero y'igitangaza, ahubwo <strong>tuzakora urutonde rwa TODO rw'ibitabo bisigaye kubikwa!</strong> Twanatangira kurota umushinga w'ubufatanye bwo kugenda kuri uru rutonde rwa TODO."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text4"
msgstr "Twakuyemo <a %(wikipedia_isbndb_com)s>ISBNdb</a>, kandi twakuyemo <a %(openlibrary)s>Open Library dataset</a>, ariko ibisubizo ntibyashimishije. Ikibazo nyamukuru cyari uko hatariho guhuza kwinshi kwa ISBNs. Reba iyi shusho ya Venn muri <a %(blog)s>inyandiko yacu ya blog</a>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text5"
msgstr "Twari twatunguwe cyane n'ukuntu hariho ihuriro rito hagati ya ISBNdb na Open Library, zombi zikaba zikubiyemo amakuru aturuka mu nkomoko zitandukanye, nk'ubusakuzi bw'urubuga n'inyandiko z'ibigo by'ububiko bw'ibitabo. Niba zombi zikora neza mu gushaka ISBN nyinshi ziri hanze aho, imizingo yazo yagombye kuba ifite ihuriro rikomeye, cyangwa imwe ikaba igice cy'iyindi. Byatumye twibaza, ni ibihe bitabo byinshi byagwa <em>burundu hanze y'iyi mizingo</em>? Dukeneye ububiko bunini."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.worldcat"
msgstr "WorldCat"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text6"
msgstr "Icyo gihe ni bwo twerekeje amaso ku bubiko bunini bw'ibitabo ku isi: <a %(wikipedia_worldcat)s>WorldCat</a>. Iyi ni database y'ubucuruzi y'ikigo kitari icya leta <a %(wikipedia_oclc)s>OCLC</a>, ikusanya inyandiko za metadata zituruka mu bigo by'ububiko bw'ibitabo byo ku isi hose, mu guha ibyo bigo ububiko bwose, no kubigaragaza mu bisubizo by'ubushakashatsi by'abakoresha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text7"
msgstr "Nubwo OCLC ari ikigo kitari icya leta, uburyo bwabo bw'ubucuruzi busaba kurinda ububiko bwabo. None, tubabajwe no kubivuga, nshuti zacu muri OCLC, turabitanze byose. :-)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text8"
msgstr "Mu mwaka ushize, twakurikiranye neza inyandiko zose za WorldCat. Mbere, twagize amahirwe. WorldCat yari ikimara gushyira hanze ivugurura ry'urubuga rwabo rwose (mu Kanama 2022). Ibi byarimo ivugurura rikomeye ry'ibisubizo byabo by'inyuma, byinjiza amakosa menshi y'umutekano. Twahise dufata amahirwe, kandi twashoboye gukurura amamiliyoni y'inyandiko mu minsi mike gusa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.alt.redesign"
msgstr "<em>Ivugurura rya WorldCat</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text9"
msgstr "Nyuma yaho, amakosa y'umutekano yagiye akosorwa buhoro buhoro, kugeza aho irya nyuma twabonye ryakosowe hafi ukwezi gushize. Icyo gihe twari dufite hafi inyandiko zose, kandi twari tugamije gusa inyandiko zifite ireme ryo hejuru. Nuko twumva ko ari igihe cyo kubishyira hanze!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text10"
msgstr "Reka turebe amakuru amwe y'ibanze ku makuru:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.data.format"
msgstr "<strong>Imiterere?</strong> <a %(blog)s>Ibikoresho bya Anna’s Archive (AAC)</a>, bikaba by'ingenzi <a %(jsonlines)s>JSON Lines</a> byahinduwe hamwe na <a %(zstd)s>Zstandard</a>, hamwe n'ubusobanuro bw'ibisanzwe. Ibi bikoresho bikubiyemo ubwoko butandukanye bw'inyandiko, hashingiwe ku busakuzi butandukanye twakoresheje."

