#, fuzzy
msgid "page.about.help.text11"
msgstr "11. Turashaka gushyiraho amatangazo mato, meza. Niba ushaka kwamamaza kuri Anna’s Archive, nyamuneka tubimenyeshe."

#, fuzzy
