#, fuzzy
msgid "page.volunteering.intro.text1"
msgstr "Anna’s Archive yishingikiriza ku bitabira nkamwe. Turakirana yombi urwego rwose rw’ubwitange, kandi dufite ibyiciro bibiri by’ingenzi by’ubufasha dukeneye:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "page.volunteering.intro.light"
